(1299003, 167610, 10170, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are absolutely hypnotic.  Great lighting and just love this photo in general.  Reminds me (as does another in this challenge) of a very famous National Geographic photo of the Afgan woman.</td>', 'Those eyes are absolutely hypnotic.  Great lighting and just love this photo in general.  Reminds me (as does another in this challenge) of a very famous National Geographic photo of the Afgan woman.', '2005-04-18 01:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
