(1299006, 167143, 10170, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning.  This has to be a ribbon I think.  Reminds me (as does another in this challenge) of a very famous National Geographic photo of the Afgan woman.</td>', 'Simply stunning.  This has to be a ribbon I think.  Reminds me (as does another in this challenge) of a very famous National Geographic photo of the Afgan woman.', '2005-04-18 01:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
