(1299027, 167372, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat capture. Serious injury to his frames, but still functioning!! Interesting looking guy and good capture. Like it.9</td>', 'Neat capture. Serious injury to his frames, but still functioning!! Interesting looking guy and good capture. Like it.9', '2005-04-18 01:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
