(1299032, 167238, 15207, '<td valign="top">The soft focus in this doesn''t seem to add much - maybe a shallower DOF would have made it stand out a bit more. I also think the composition could have benefitted from using the rule of 3rds. The highlights are also a bit strong. 5</td>', 'The soft focus in this doesn''t seem to add much - maybe a shallower DOF would have made it stand out a bit more. I also think the composition could have benefitted from using the rule of 3rds. The highlights are also a bit strong. 5', '2005-04-18 01:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
