(1299316, 167324, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like where this is going. That sun is so warm. The face needs to be lightened though and more in focus. The girl somehow is competing with the tree behind her for attention. Its a little distracting.</td>', 'I like where this is going. That sun is so warm. The face needs to be lightened though and more in focus. The girl somehow is competing with the tree behind her for attention. Its a little distracting.', '2005-04-18 02:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299317, 167482, 24976, '<td valign="top">seems that you lost some detail in the black clothes (or it could always just be my monitor)... I really want to like this photo, it has really the ingredients for an outstanding capture but i feel that as is presented it lacks a central point of focus, the balance of people on the page is not really strong compositionally, the problem with the darks, and i guess also the shallow dof./ lack of sharpness. 7</td>', 'seems that you lost some detail in the black clothes (or it could always just be my monitor)... I really want to like this photo, it has really the ingredients for an outstanding capture but i feel that as is presented it lacks a central point of focus, the balance of people on the page is not really strong compositionally, the problem with the darks, and i guess also the shallow dof./ lack of sharpness. 7', '2005-04-18 03:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299318, 167752, 24976, '<td valign="top">cropping a little off each side to make the image a sqaure might have worked really well here.</td>', 'cropping a little off each side to make the image a sqaure might have worked really well here.', '2005-04-18 03:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299321, 167657, 19952, '<td valign="top">This photo is absolutely brilliant. The right cheek is a little hot, but it doesn''t bleed into the background so it still helps define the curves of the subject''s face. Very nicely done.</td>', 'This photo is absolutely brilliant. The right cheek is a little hot, but it doesn''t bleed into the background so it still helps define the curves of the subject''s face. Very nicely done.', '2005-04-18 03:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299322, 167547, 24976, '<td valign="top">a little less sand and a lot more sky would have really made this imo, i think it would have brought in a feeling of limitlessness and freedom. Otherwise a great capture. 8</td>', 'a little less sand and a lot more sky would have really made this imo, i think it would have brought in a feeling of limitlessness and freedom. Otherwise a great capture. 8', '2005-04-18 03:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299326, 167806, 31742, '<td valign="top">Tracy???</td>', 'Tracy???', '2005-04-18 03:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299327, 167143, 35547, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful image - incredible eyes and great lighting. However I think it''s oversharpened, the eyes are overwhitened, and the cloning for strays could''ve been cleaner (left of nose, forehead, etc). Also, top right corner could''ve been worked better. When the challenge is over, I''d love to see the original. Even without all the processing I''m sure it has plenty of heart.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful image - incredible eyes and great lighting. However I think it''s oversharpened, the eyes are overwhitened, and the cloning for strays could''ve been cleaner (left of nose, forehead, etc). Also, top right corner could''ve been worked better. When the challenge is over, I''d love to see the original. Even without all the processing I''m sure it has plenty of heart.', '2005-04-18 03:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299336, 167695, 31742, '<td valign="top">Wow that is s0o0o0 Cool  !!! 10</td>', 'Wow that is s0o0o0 Cool  !!! 10', '2005-04-18 03:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299337, 165672, 35547, '<td valign="top">Great capture, like the emotion. The skin processing / noise reduction is pushed a little far though; getting very close to the plastic doll look. Kid skin is smooth enough as is, no need to process it further.</td>', 'Great capture, like the emotion. The skin processing / noise reduction is pushed a little far though; getting very close to the plastic doll look. Kid skin is smooth enough as is, no need to process it further.', '2005-04-18 03:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
