(1299449, 167583, 28742, '<td valign="top">I like the title - God''s beautiful creations enjoyed by tourists from different cultures and... Wait a minute... Now I see what you meant! I LOVE the title.<br/>This photo has some great composition for captioning!<br/>Tibetan Monk Boy captures groping on his camera phone, sends to his buddies back at the Monestary. Kid in stroller is oblivious. Woman pushing stroller pretends not to notice. Dad is amused until he notices that''s his niece in the pink tank top. Kid on shoulders asks Dad: "Where do babies come from?"<br/>hehehe. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the title - God''s beautiful creations enjoyed by tourists from different cultures and... Wait a minute... Now I see what you meant! I LOVE the title.This photo has some great composition for captioning!Tibetan Monk Boy captures groping on his camera phone, sends to his buddies back at the Monestary. Kid in stroller is oblivious. Woman pushing stroller pretends not to notice. Dad is amused until he notices that''s his niece in the pink tank top. Kid on shoulders asks Dad: "Where do babies come from?"hehehe. Nice shot.', '2005-04-18 04:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
