(1299580, 167193, 30861, '<td valign="top">Personally I find this hysterical and arresting. It''s bright, vibrant, moderately insane. Hope it does well.</td>', 'Personally I find this hysterical and arresting. It''s bright, vibrant, moderately insane. Hope it does well.', '2005-04-18 06:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299581, 167372, 30861, '<td valign="top">IMO by far the best entry of this sort of picture in the challenge. I look at it and look at it and keep finding more. The condition of the eyeglasses, of course, is key to the whole thing, as is the lovingly-rendered sense of texture throuighout.</td>', 'IMO by far the best entry of this sort of picture in the challenge. I look at it and look at it and keep finding more. The condition of the eyeglasses, of course, is key to the whole thing, as is the lovingly-rendered sense of texture throuighout.', '2005-04-18 06:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299582, 167419, 30861, '<td valign="top">The title says it all. Very strong entry, beautifully made.</td>', 'The title says it all. Very strong entry, beautifully made.', '2005-04-18 06:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299583, 167686, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is downright arresting, almost disturbing. Wonderful tonalities, in an image with depth.</td>', 'This is downright arresting, almost disturbing. Wonderful tonalities, in an image with depth.', '2005-04-18 06:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299585, 166993, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the skin tones and the wide range of rich colors. I remember those bluebonnets from when we used to live in Austin. :-)</td>', 'Nice job with the skin tones and the wide range of rich colors. I remember those bluebonnets from when we used to live in Austin. :-)', '2005-04-18 06:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299587, 167137, 8643, '<td valign="top">Just a tad oversharpened for me.</td>', 'Just a tad oversharpened for me.', '2005-04-18 06:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299589, 167217, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice subject with excellent bright colors. The picture does seem quite a bit washed out, so you might want to darken it to increase the tonal range of this image. Other than that, really nicely done!</td>', 'This is a really nice subject with excellent bright colors. The picture does seem quite a bit washed out, so you might want to darken it to increase the tonal range of this image. Other than that, really nicely done!', '2005-04-18 06:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299590, 167729, 8643, '<td valign="top">The female on the far bank keeps catchong one''s eye. . .</td>', 'The female on the far bank keeps catchong one''s eye. . .', '2005-04-18 06:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299594, 167824, 19952, '<td valign="top">Looks good! :-) The image is just a little bit washed out, though. If you set her pupill or some other particularly dark area as the black spot, it should make the colors look even richer. Nicely done!</td>', 'Looks good! :-) The image is just a little bit washed out, though. If you set her pupill or some other particularly dark area as the black spot, it should make the colors look even richer. Nicely done!', '2005-04-18 06:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299595, 167706, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - maybe crop some off the right, so the figure is not central? and reduce the intensity a tiny bit on the left.</td>', 'Nice idea - maybe crop some off the right, so the figure is not central? and reduce the intensity a tiny bit on the left.', '2005-04-18 06:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299605, 167766, 8643, '<td valign="top">You crop this, 20% off the top and the left, to give a similar feel, without so much distraction from the blown waves, and provide more attention on your lovely subject, who is nicely lit and captured.</td>', 'You crop this, 20% off the top and the left, to give a similar feel, without so much distraction from the blown waves, and provide more attention on your lovely subject, who is nicely lit and captured.', '2005-04-18 07:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299609, 167725, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like this shot the compoition is good, but maybee a slight rotation anticlockwise is required.</td>', 'I like this shot the compoition is good, but maybee a slight rotation anticlockwise is required.', '2005-04-18 07:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299610, 167459, 19952, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot. It does seem to be a little washed out and to have a slightly green caste, but that''s easy to take care of. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot. It does seem to be a little washed out and to have a slightly green caste, but that''s easy to take care of. Nicely done.', '2005-04-18 07:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299614, 167593, 32767, '<td valign="top">A little too much like a snapshot. The hands a distraction.</td>', 'A little too much like a snapshot. The hands a distraction.', '2005-04-18 07:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299615, 167437, 9939, '<td valign="top">Stunning, of course. Thanks Manny. 10</td>', 'Stunning, of course. Thanks Manny. 10', '2005-04-18 07:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299618, 165672, 9939, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. 9.', '2005-04-18 07:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299622, 166030, 9939, '<td valign="top">I think you''ll get hammered for the processing in this shot- it is quite a bit overdone. That may have been the effect you were going for but I don''t think it works in favor of this lovely subject- this would have been a wonderful portrait without the processing.</td>', 'I think you''ll get hammered for the processing in this shot- it is quite a bit overdone. That may have been the effect you were going for but I don''t think it works in favor of this lovely subject- this would have been a wonderful portrait without the processing.', '2005-04-18 07:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299625, 166909, 8643, '<td valign="top">An excellent portrait - lovely.</td>', 'An excellent portrait - lovely.', '2005-04-18 07:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299626, 167078, 9939, '<td valign="top">I just calibrated my monitor last night- your background has some consistency issues, particularly around the back of her head and down her back. The position of the model feels somewhat uncomfortable, and my eye keeps going to the bottom of her shoe and her pantyline- very distracting. Great subject, perhaps another image from the shoot might have been stronger.</td>', 'I just calibrated my monitor last night- your background has some consistency issues, particularly around the back of her head and down her back. The position of the model feels somewhat uncomfortable, and my eye keeps going to the bottom of her shoe and her pantyline- very distracting. Great subject, perhaps another image from the shoot might have been stronger.', '2005-04-18 07:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299628, 167291, 8643, '<td valign="top">Crop out the top 15% - to avoid the distraction of the house?  Otherwise an attractive portrait.</td>', 'Crop out the top 15% - to avoid the distraction of the house?  Otherwise an attractive portrait.', '2005-04-18 07:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299629, 166355, 9939, '<td valign="top">I''ve taken a lot of shots like this one but didn''t do anything with them because I realized that there was nothing to draw the viewer into the scene- just as this group was closed off to you when you shot it, they''re also closed off to us.</td>', 'I''ve taken a lot of shots like this one but didn''t do anything with them because I realized that there was nothing to draw the viewer into the scene- just as this group was closed off to you when you shot it, they''re also closed off to us.', '2005-04-18 07:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299632, 167722, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice clean portrait, pleasing composition, pity about the background.</td>', 'Nice clean portrait, pleasing composition, pity about the background.', '2005-04-18 07:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299633, 167821, 9939, '<td valign="top">This should be an ad, or a greeting card, or something. Really cute. Great capture. Nothing to suggest, it''s excellent!</td>', 'This should be an ad, or a greeting card, or something. Really cute. Great capture. Nothing to suggest, it''s excellent!', '2005-04-18 07:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299636, 167487, 9939, '<td valign="top">As soon as it came up on screen I thought it was ever so slightly motion blurred. Now in studying it I can see that his eyes are sharp, his headwear is relatively sharp, but perhaps the pattern is tricking my eye- it can''t seem to settle on the image. Great capture though.</td>', 'As soon as it came up on screen I thought it was ever so slightly motion blurred. Now in studying it I can see that his eyes are sharp, his headwear is relatively sharp, but perhaps the pattern is tricking my eye- it can''t seem to settle on the image. Great capture though.', '2005-04-18 07:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299638, 167329, 8643, '<td valign="top">There are 3 good photos here - this one and another two, produced by hard crops to each pair, taking out the chairs!</td>', 'There are 3 good photos here - this one and another two, produced by hard crops to each pair, taking out the chairs!', '2005-04-18 07:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299639, 167154, 32767, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Nice concept. 8</td>', 'Very well done. Nice concept. 8', '2005-04-18 07:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299640, 167615, 8643, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea but her face looks either out of focus or she moved???  As the centre of attention, maybe she needs to be clearer?</td>', 'Really nice idea but her face looks either out of focus or she moved???  As the centre of attention, maybe she needs to be clearer?', '2005-04-18 07:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299642, 167143, 9939, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous model, very nice framing. Though the noise on her face and hair is somewhat detrimental. Still a 7 in my book.</td>', 'Gorgeous model, very nice framing. Though the noise on her face and hair is somewhat detrimental. Still a 7 in my book.', '2005-04-18 07:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299644, 166452, 9939, '<td valign="top">What a vivid shot. Nice work. A wider aperture might have helped to separate them off the background a bit more. 7.</td>', 'What a vivid shot. Nice work. A wider aperture might have helped to separate them off the background a bit more. 7.', '2005-04-18 07:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299645, 167729, 32767, '<td valign="top">A little too much space and not level.</td>', 'A little too much space and not level.', '2005-04-18 07:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299646, 166438, 23458, '<td valign="top">The dark area on the right of the frame is really distracting - if you cropped that out I''m sure it would add significant to the image. Aside from that I really like the moment you have captured here. 6.</td>', 'The dark area on the right of the frame is really distracting - if you cropped that out I''m sure it would add significant to the image. Aside from that I really like the moment you have captured here. 6.', '2005-04-18 07:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299647, 166993, 9939, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a Norman Rockwell painting. Really nice. Love the quirky hair sticking up on the left ;) 8.</td>', 'This reminds me of a Norman Rockwell painting. Really nice. Love the quirky hair sticking up on the left ;) 8.', '2005-04-18 07:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299648, 167816, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great tones here - the image quality is a little off but besides that (and what is suspect might be an excess of neat image) I really like this.</td>', 'Great tones here - the image quality is a little off but besides that (and what is suspect might be an excess of neat image) I really like this.', '2005-04-18 07:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299650, 167722, 9939, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, great expression. The only thing just a tiny bit bothersome is the missing hand.</td>', 'Excellent capture, great expression. The only thing just a tiny bit bothersome is the missing hand.', '2005-04-18 07:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299651, 167708, 32767, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped out Moms shoulder. The lighting''s a bit harsh, could have been done a little softer IMHO.</td>', 'I might have cropped out Moms shoulder. The lighting''s a bit harsh, could have been done a little softer IMHO.', '2005-04-18 07:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299652, 167222, 9939, '<td valign="top">I think you could have gotten closer in on your subject but used the same composition and had a more effective shot- as it is framed we have more wall than we need to get the idea and are left wanting to see more details of the girl. Great idea, very striking photo.</td>', 'I think you could have gotten closer in on your subject but used the same composition and had a more effective shot- as it is framed we have more wall than we need to get the idea and are left wanting to see more details of the girl. Great idea, very striking photo.', '2005-04-18 07:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299654, 167824, 8643, '<td valign="top">Superb!  Must ribbon. . .</td>', 'Superb!  Must ribbon. . .', '2005-04-18 07:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299656, 167660, 8643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait - lovely soft tones and nice gentle shadows.  To nitpick, I find the blue bottom left is distracting - perhaps a tighter crop would overcome this?  The necklace distracts too but this image is still my choice (one of only two) for a ribbon!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait - lovely soft tones and nice gentle shadows.  To nitpick, I find the blue bottom left is distracting - perhaps a tighter crop would overcome this?  The necklace distracts too but this image is still my choice (one of only two) for a ribbon!', '2005-04-18 07:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299658, 167483, 8643, '<td valign="top">Unusual and very eye catching - the inclusion of the shadow provides balance.  Well captured!</td>', 'Unusual and very eye catching - the inclusion of the shadow provides balance.  Well captured!', '2005-04-18 07:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299661, 166408, 8643, '<td valign="top">Love this - the background adds to the image but perhaps I would have cropped tighter, a little off each side, maintaining the asymmetry.</td>', 'Love this - the background adds to the image but perhaps I would have cropped tighter, a little off each side, maintaining the asymmetry.', '2005-04-18 07:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299663, 167336, 9939, '<td valign="top">The blurring of everything else in shot, including some of the subject''s own hair, looks very unnatural and makes the subject look like she was pasted into the photo in some places. I think a more natural treatment would have suited this lovely photo much better.</td>', 'The blurring of everything else in shot, including some of the subject''s own hair, looks very unnatural and makes the subject look like she was pasted into the photo in some places. I think a more natural treatment would have suited this lovely photo much better.', '2005-04-18 07:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299665, 167596, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - but I''d like to see it without the selective desat.  Crisp main subjects and nice soft background.</td>', 'Nice idea - but I''d like to see it without the selective desat.  Crisp main subjects and nice soft background.', '2005-04-18 07:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299666, 167279, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very cute! Contrast seems a bit low in places, and bringing the subject and what she''s on away from the background would have helped to throw the background out of focus. It''s a little distracting as is.</td>', 'Very cute! Contrast seems a bit low in places, and bringing the subject and what she''s on away from the background would have helped to throw the background out of focus. It''s a little distracting as is.', '2005-04-18 07:47:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1299667, 167256, 9939, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture in all respects. 10.</td>', 'Beautiful capture in all respects. 10.', '2005-04-18 07:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299668, 167487, 8643, '<td valign="top">Delightful study - pity about the other face in the background.</td>', 'Delightful study - pity about the other face in the background.', '2005-04-18 07:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299671, 167143, 8643, '<td valign="top">Stunning; eye catching.  Perhaps a bit over sharpened for my taste.</td>', 'Stunning; eye catching.  Perhaps a bit over sharpened for my taste.', '2005-04-18 07:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299672, 167483, 9939, '<td valign="top">What a lucky background! Great capture. If you had others with the centurian looking more in the direction of the camera it might have served to draw the viewer into the shot more.</td>', 'What a lucky background! Great capture. If you had others with the centurian looking more in the direction of the camera it might have served to draw the viewer into the shot more.', '2005-04-18 07:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299673, 166474, 8643, '<td valign="top">Charming!</td>', 'Charming!', '2005-04-18 07:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299675, 167658, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice photojournalistic shot. I think the choice of black and white was a good one.</td>', 'Nice photojournalistic shot. I think the choice of black and white was a good one.', '2005-04-18 07:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299676, 167178, 9939, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture. Congrats. 10.</td>', 'Fantastic capture. Congrats. 10.', '2005-04-18 07:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299677, 167783, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and evocative shot!</td>', 'Very interesting and evocative shot!', '2005-04-18 07:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299679, 167482, 9939, '<td valign="top">This is a busy shot,  andto my eye  the subjects aren''t well enough separated from their background. A tighter crop removing the two guys in the rear might have helped make the three in the foreground more present.</td>', 'This is a busy shot,  andto my eye  the subjects aren''t well enough separated from their background. A tighter crop removing the two guys in the rear might have helped make the three in the foreground more present.', '2005-04-18 07:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299680, 166638, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great photo, great composition. You could even crop a little tighter. The "glow" around the subject is so cool.</td>', 'Great photo, great composition. You could even crop a little tighter. The "glow" around the subject is so cool.', '2005-04-18 07:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299686, 167706, 31443, '<td valign="top">Scary!  At first I thought no no don´t like it but it did catch my attention and affected me, so 6</td>', 'Scary!  At first I thought no no don´t like it but it did catch my attention and affected me, so 6', '2005-04-18 08:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299687, 167522, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and a happy face, pretty also...</td>', 'Nicely done and a happy face, pretty also...', '2005-04-18 08:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299693, 166956, 16241, '<td valign="top">pretty</td>', 'pretty', '2005-04-18 08:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299695, 166853, 9939, '<td valign="top">If you took other shots of her looking somewhere in the direction of the camera they might have been stronger images. This shot appears to have focus on her necklace, but focusing on her eyes might have been a better choice.</td>', 'If you took other shots of her looking somewhere in the direction of the camera they might have been stronger images. This shot appears to have focus on her necklace, but focusing on her eyes might have been a better choice.', '2005-04-18 08:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299696, 167486, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-04-18 08:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299699, 166309, 9939, '<td valign="top">What an evocative shot. I only wish for a little more light on the right side, o n he backs of the subjects, to give a little more detail to their clothes.</td>', 'What an evocative shot. I only wish for a little more light on the right side, o n he backs of the subjects, to give a little more detail to their clothes.', '2005-04-18 08:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299701, 166311, 9939, '<td valign="top">Without seeing the subjects eyes it''s pretty difficult for the viewer to be drawn into the photo.</td>', 'Without seeing the subjects eyes it''s pretty difficult for the viewer to be drawn into the photo.', '2005-04-18 08:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299702, 167287, 16241, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2005-04-18 08:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299703, 167607, 16241, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2005-04-18 08:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299704, 166694, 16241, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2005-04-18 08:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299705, 167747, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Nothing to suggest here.</td>', 'Very nice capture. Nothing to suggest here.', '2005-04-18 08:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299706, 167802, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very unique, great colors!</td>', 'Very unique, great colors!', '2005-04-18 08:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299708, 167657, 9939, '<td valign="top">Wow- what a commanding shot. Those are some intense eyes! Love the crop, love the clarity of the image, nothing to suggest! It''s excellent!</td>', 'Wow- what a commanding shot. Those are some intense eyes! Love the crop, love the clarity of the image, nothing to suggest! It''s excellent!', '2005-04-18 08:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299710, 167372, 9939, '<td valign="top">Indeed- really makes the viewer want to study him! I might have asked if he''d stop and pose for a few shots, or at least fire off several in a row and see if he looks more in the direction of the camera. The frame bisecting his right eye is a tad distracting.</td>', 'Indeed- really makes the viewer want to study him! I might have asked if he''d stop and pose for a few shots, or at least fire off several in a row and see if he looks more in the direction of the camera. The frame bisecting his right eye is a tad distracting.', '2005-04-18 08:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299711, 165255, 9939, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot- nothing to suggest. 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot- nothing to suggest. 10.', '2005-04-18 08:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299714, 166212, 33379, '<td valign="top">ok your my first vote cause this photo stood out to me in the thumbnails!! great job!</td>', 'ok your my first vote cause this photo stood out to me in the thumbnails!! great job!', '2005-04-18 08:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299720, 167816, 9939, '<td valign="top">I really like the lightand the crop here, but the processing leaves something to be desired. Looks like a lot of artifacts around his hair and eyes and nostrils.</td>', 'I really like the lightand the crop here, but the processing leaves something to be desired. Looks like a lot of artifacts around his hair and eyes and nostrils.', '2005-04-18 08:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299721, 167824, 33379, '<td valign="top">i like the close up!</td>', 'i like the close up!', '2005-04-18 08:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299725, 167215, 9939, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture- dad looks like he''s got a tiny bit of motion blur and the little one''s shirt is blown out, so maybe a slightly faster shutter speed?</td>', 'Lovely capture- dad looks like he''s got a tiny bit of motion blur and the little one''s shirt is blown out, so maybe a slightly faster shutter speed?', '2005-04-18 08:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299729, 167279, 36361, '<td valign="top">What a beauty!</td>', 'What a beauty!', '2005-04-18 08:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299730, 167339, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, lighting and composition. I don''t think this needed the selective desat.</td>', 'Nice setup, lighting and composition. I don''t think this needed the selective desat.', '2005-04-18 08:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299733, 167591, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but this looks really overdone and fake. The water at the horizon was obviously cloned at least once, maybe twice and the colors, while fantastic, are just that- fantastic.</td>', 'Nice idea, but this looks really overdone and fake. The water at the horizon was obviously cloned at least once, maybe twice and the colors, while fantastic, are just that- fantastic.', '2005-04-18 08:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299734, 167447, 13602, '<td valign="top">Blonde gipsy... hmmm. Nice picture regardless, maybe lacks a bit of more contrast.</td>', 'Blonde gipsy... hmmm. Nice picture regardless, maybe lacks a bit of more contrast.', '2005-04-18 08:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299736, 167695, 33379, '<td valign="top">i see the vase but what does it have to do with people? haha just jokin sounds like a dumb comment someone would say..like the idea though!</td>', 'i see the vase but what does it have to do with people? haha just jokin sounds like a dumb comment someone would say..like the idea though!', '2005-04-18 08:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299738, 166548, 33379, '<td valign="top">gangsta!</td>', 'gangsta!', '2005-04-18 08:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299739, 167417, 9939, '<td valign="top">People may tell you that the soft focus is too much, but I think it''s excellent here. Great choice for this subject- she''s got an absolutely angelic face. 10.</td>', 'People may tell you that the soft focus is too much, but I think it''s excellent here. Great choice for this subject- she''s got an absolutely angelic face. 10.', '2005-04-18 08:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299740, 167810, 33379, '<td valign="top">funny title</td>', 'funny title', '2005-04-18 08:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299741, 167279, 33379, '<td valign="top">love the hair</td>', 'love the hair', '2005-04-18 08:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299742, 166999, 13602, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, 10 good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful composition, 10 good luck!', '2005-04-18 08:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299743, 167581, 13602, '<td valign="top">Verry nice, good luck 10!</td>', 'Verry nice, good luck 10!', '2005-04-18 08:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299745, 166993, 33379, '<td valign="top">very nice photo</td>', 'very nice photo', '2005-04-18 08:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299747, 167071, 13602, '<td valign="top">Verry interesting, one of the best in challenge, my 10, good luck!</td>', 'Verry interesting, one of the best in challenge, my 10, good luck!', '2005-04-18 08:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299748, 167290, 9939, '<td valign="top">Shadow and highlight might have been used a little too much to brighten the shadow- otherwise great capture.</td>', 'Shadow and highlight might have been used a little too much to brighten the shadow- otherwise great capture.', '2005-04-18 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299751, 165430, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, though the crop might be unnecessarily tight. Also looks like you''ve got some motion blur, makes it difficult for the viewer''s eye to settle on and investigate the image.</td>', 'Nice composition, though the crop might be unnecessarily tight. Also looks like you''ve got some motion blur, makes it difficult for the viewer''s eye to settle on and investigate the image.', '2005-04-18 08:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
