(1299756, 167414, 9939, '<td valign="top">Composition feels very unbalanced to me, and while the depth of field is great for pulling the subject off the background it also doesn''t leave us enough information about the surroundings to know what''s going on.</td>', 'Composition feels very unbalanced to me, and while the depth of field is great for pulling the subject off the background it also doesn''t leave us enough information about the surroundings to know what''s going on.', '2005-04-18 08:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
