(1299759, 167708, 9939, '<td valign="top">The light here looks a bit harsh and unnatural and Mom''s bright white shirt takes up more of the frame than it should in my opinion. Perhaps a different arrangement of the subjects- not to mention getting Mom to smile so she doesn''t look so incongrouous with her smiling and happy daughter- might make this a more pleasing portrait.</td>', 'The light here looks a bit harsh and unnatural and Mom''s bright white shirt takes up more of the frame than it should in my opinion. Perhaps a different arrangement of the subjects- not to mention getting Mom to smile so she doesn''t look so incongrouous with her smiling and happy daughter- might make this a more pleasing portrait.', '2005-04-18 08:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1299761, 167757, 9939, '<td valign="top">Without being able to even see their eyes, or better have them looking in the direction of the camera, there is nothing to draw the viewers into this shot. We are as closed off from the subjects as you were. If you have no interaction wtih them, neither do we.</td>', 'Without being able to even see their eyes, or better have them looking in the direction of the camera, there is nothing to draw the viewers into this shot. We are as closed off from the subjects as you were. If you have no interaction wtih them, neither do we.', '2005-04-18 08:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
