(1301023, 167588, 4493, '<td valign="top">Does the color add to this shot? I think a nice contrasty b/w tone would work well. When working with a high sun like this, and monotone tones, a b/w treatment can usually add to the emotive quality of shots like this.</td>', 'Does the color add to this shot? I think a nice contrasty b/w tone would work well. When working with a high sun like this, and monotone tones, a b/w treatment can usually add to the emotive quality of shots like this.', '2005-04-18 16:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301026, 167198, 4493, '<td valign="top">I just resized my browser so I could scroll the image and crop out the boy from the shot. When I did this, it may the image much stronger by removing the clutter on the left side of the frame. Cropping is an important tool. Removing elements that don''t add to the shot will usually make a stronger presentation.</td>', 'I just resized my browser so I could scroll the image and crop out the boy from the shot. When I did this, it may the image much stronger by removing the clutter on the left side of the frame. Cropping is an important tool. Removing elements that don''t add to the shot will usually make a stronger presentation.', '2005-04-18 16:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301033, 166438, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like your posing done here. Nice layers. I would have cropped out the far right myself. Otherwise it''s very well done.</td>', 'I like your posing done here. Nice layers. I would have cropped out the far right myself. Otherwise it''s very well done.', '2005-04-18 16:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
