(1301041, 167143, 26756, '<td valign="top">A great, expressive shot and sure to do well.  This is the first time I won''t openly say this is Librodo because there is one other shot in this challenge that is good enough to be his.<br/> <br/>Some nit-picks for what they are worth:  I get the sense that this photo may have been over-sharpened a bit.  The eyes may have been whitened just a tad too much as well.  If not, they are the whitest eyes in the world. <br/> <br/>Aside from that?  Love it.  The color and textures of the shawl are beautiful, as is the strand of hair over the face.  Fantastic job.</td>', 'A great, expressive shot and sure to do well.  This is the first time I won''t openly say this is Librodo because there is one other shot in this challenge that is good enough to be his. Some nit-picks for what they are worth:  I get the sense that this photo may have been over-sharpened a bit.  The eyes may have been whitened just a tad too much as well.  If not, they are the whitest eyes in the world.  Aside from that?  Love it.  The color and textures of the shawl are beautiful, as is the strand of hair over the face.  Fantastic job.', '2005-04-18 16:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
