(1301364, 167290, 24454, '<td valign="top">SUCH a great photo.   The title is perfect because that''s exactly what I think when I look at him -- like he''s got a million interesting stories to tell.  I love the composition on this, and the focus is perfect.   I just love the picture itself!     Perffect 10.</td>', 'SUCH a great photo.   The title is perfect because that''s exactly what I think when I look at him -- like he''s got a million interesting stories to tell.  I love the composition on this, and the focus is perfect.   I just love the picture itself!     Perffect 10.', '2005-04-18 17:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301365, 165672, 6999, '<td valign="top">High marks from me. Dynamic, genuine, enthused, and a marvellously instant composition. Highly engaging, and very real. I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'High marks from me. Dynamic, genuine, enthused, and a marvellously instant composition. Highly engaging, and very real. I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2005-04-18 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301370, 167125, 6999, '<td valign="top">As it is, and as it occurs: angular, taking a moment to absorb, apparently structured, but needing interpretation, and making some sense of the chaos. Signature stuff, I think.</td>', 'As it is, and as it occurs: angular, taking a moment to absorb, apparently structured, but needing interpretation, and making some sense of the chaos. Signature stuff, I think.', '2005-04-18 17:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
