(1301479, 167323, 24454, '<td valign="top">She is so cute!    This picture does so well at capturing a little face with so much personality!  I love it!     I love the black and white too!</td>', 'She is so cute!    This picture does so well at capturing a little face with so much personality!  I love it!     I love the black and white too!', '2005-04-18 18:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
