(1301482, 166240, 35804, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a little nicer with a bit more breating room, too tight a crop maybe? I like the sepia tone.</td>', 'I think this would be a little nicer with a bit more breating room, too tight a crop maybe? I like the sepia tone.', '2005-04-18 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
