(1301969, 166030, 35895, '<td valign="top">excellent portrait. in my opinion this shot could have been better if it didnt look so post-processed.</td>', 'excellent portrait. in my opinion this shot could have been better if it didnt look so post-processed.', '2005-04-18 23:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301979, 166408, 25464, '<td valign="top">Well, nothing like a bullseye between breasts to get the guys attention.  I think the colors work well with the subject and the light is nice.  I think it needed to be cropped much closer.  The wall is overpowering the subject.  The pose (missing arms) seems a bit strange to me as well.  She is very beautiful, and the tilt of her head really shows off the shap of her face and jawline.  Good work overall.</td>', 'Well, nothing like a bullseye between breasts to get the guys attention.  I think the colors work well with the subject and the light is nice.  I think it needed to be cropped much closer.  The wall is overpowering the subject.  The pose (missing arms) seems a bit strange to me as well.  She is very beautiful, and the tilt of her head really shows off the shap of her face and jawline.  Good work overall.', '2005-04-18 23:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301980, 165601, 25464, '<td valign="top">This shot shows great character in the subject.  I am really bothered by the glasses cutting through the eyes.  I think a bit lower angle would have made this perfect.</td>', 'This shot shows great character in the subject.  I am really bothered by the glasses cutting through the eyes.  I think a bit lower angle would have made this perfect.', '2005-04-18 23:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301982, 167143, 30214, '<td valign="top">predictable - yes. Beautiful - yes!</td>', 'predictable - yes. Beautiful - yes!', '2005-04-18 23:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301986, 165601, 30214, '<td valign="top">what a face!</td>', 'what a face!', '2005-04-18 23:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301988, 167153, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the image is way overprocessed.  I am sure the baby is very soft without processing.  The treatment takes away from the elderly arm by smoothing out the lines too much.  Great eyes and imagination.  I would try this one again.</td>', 'Nice composition, but the image is way overprocessed.  I am sure the baby is very soft without processing.  The treatment takes away from the elderly arm by smoothing out the lines too much.  Great eyes and imagination.  I would try this one again.', '2005-04-18 23:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1301990, 167604, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice photo in terms of composition and lighting, but the focus could''ve been crispier</td>', 'nice photo in terms of composition and lighting, but the focus could''ve been crispier', '2005-04-18 23:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
