(1302023, 167360, 6668, '<td valign="top">Although this shot meets the challenge topic, to me the photo itself lacks impact to hold a viewers attention.</td>', 'Although this shot meets the challenge topic, to me the photo itself lacks impact to hold a viewers attention.', '2005-04-18 23:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
