(1302026, 167583, 35739, '<td valign="top">I laughed when I read your title for this.  Wish it was clearer.</td>', 'I laughed when I read your title for this.  Wish it was clearer.', '2005-04-18 23:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302027, 167824, 25464, '<td valign="top">Jasmine is beautiful.  I think the almost white background on the left detracts from the shot a bit.  I think a bit more of the head dress showing on that side to frame in her face, and a black or darker background would improve the shot.  Also, a bit more light in the eyes to really make the catchlight and lashes sparkle.  I also think a bit more space under her face would help it look less crowded in the frame.  The skin tone and the choice of color for her are great.  She looks almost golden.  Wow  what a thought, she would make an amazing art shot with gold body pant on her skin.</td>', 'Jasmine is beautiful.  I think the almost white background on the left detracts from the shot a bit.  I think a bit more of the head dress showing on that side to frame in her face, and a black or darker background would improve the shot.  Also, a bit more light in the eyes to really make the catchlight and lashes sparkle.  I also think a bit more space under her face would help it look less crowded in the frame.  The skin tone and the choice of color for her are great.  She looks almost golden.  Wow  what a thought, she would make an amazing art shot with gold body pant on her skin.', '2005-04-18 23:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302029, 167591, 18728, '<td valign="top">Awsome shot. Great colors and nce over all effect. Its a picture pefect candid shot :)</td>', 'Awsome shot. Great colors and nce over all effect. Its a picture pefect candid shot :)', '2005-04-18 23:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302032, 167530, 25464, '<td valign="top">Too dark IMO.</td>', 'Too dark IMO.', '2005-04-18 23:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302033, 167831, 18728, '<td valign="top">very nice indeed. Great capture... well done :)</td>', 'very nice indeed. Great capture... well done :)', '2005-04-18 23:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302034, 167279, 18728, '<td valign="top">awww, soooo cute :)</td>', 'awww, soooo cute :)', '2005-04-18 23:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302037, 167713, 25464, '<td valign="top">Little girls on the move need their feet.  The desat is cute.  The shadow on her face is pretty harsh.</td>', 'Little girls on the move need their feet.  The desat is cute.  The shadow on her face is pretty harsh.', '2005-04-18 23:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302042, 167735, 25464, '<td valign="top">The lighting is way too harsh.  Also, none of these girls look very happy.  I don''t blame them.  I think maybe their hair is pulled way too tight!  : )  Actually, I think the shadows are creating that illusion.</td>', 'The lighting is way too harsh.  Also, none of these girls look very happy.  I don''t blame them.  I think maybe their hair is pulled way too tight!  : )  Actually, I think the shadows are creating that illusion.', '2005-04-18 23:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302048, 167125, 6668, '<td valign="top">Love the lines in this shot!</td>', 'Love the lines in this shot!', '2005-04-18 23:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302051, 165255, 18728, '<td valign="top">THE BEST PICTURE OF THIS CONTEST..... I guess that says it all for me :)</td>', 'THE BEST PICTURE OF THIS CONTEST..... I guess that says it all for me :)', '2005-04-18 23:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302055, 167591, 35739, '<td valign="top">Colors are beautiful.</td>', 'Colors are beautiful.', '2005-04-18 23:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302061, 167804, 25464, '<td valign="top">The eyes are amazing.  The pose/crop is bothering me a bit.  She looks like a tiny girl with an oversized shoulder.  I like this better with a crop that comes into the shoulder.  The ends of her hair look a bit oversharpened or just dry.  I bet she has baby fine hair.  A bit of spray conditioner might be in order for next time to hold the hair together a bit and give it some shine on the ends.  The face is really great though.  I try to point out everything I see that might be helpful.  I really had to look hard. : )</td>', 'The eyes are amazing.  The pose/crop is bothering me a bit.  She looks like a tiny girl with an oversized shoulder.  I like this better with a crop that comes into the shoulder.  The ends of her hair look a bit oversharpened or just dry.  I bet she has baby fine hair.  A bit of spray conditioner might be in order for next time to hold the hair together a bit and give it some shine on the ends.  The face is really great though.  I try to point out everything I see that might be helpful.  I really had to look hard. : )', '2005-04-18 23:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302065, 167234, 35739, '<td valign="top">I do not know why, but I like this shot and the different expressions of your subjects.</td>', 'I do not know why, but I like this shot and the different expressions of your subjects.', '2005-04-18 23:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1302078, 167143, 35739, '<td valign="top">Too me it looks like there is too much contrast. Beautiful subject.</td>', 'Too me it looks like there is too much contrast. Beautiful subject.', '2005-04-18 23:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
