(1303431, 167618, 35352, '<td valign="top">This photo is great - the 3 features (woman, man, stonewall) are each distinctive and symbolic yet tie together well.<br/> <br/>I think this photo has taught me something. My gut reaction is that the guy isn''t framed well - he is too hidden. But maybe I''m jumping to quickly. maybe its a symbol of the union he''s just made.</td>', 'This photo is great - the 3 features (woman, man, stonewall) are each distinctive and symbolic yet tie together well. I think this photo has taught me something. My gut reaction is that the guy isn''t framed well - he is too hidden. But maybe I''m jumping to quickly. maybe its a symbol of the union he''s just made.', '2005-04-19 09:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303440, 167254, 35352, '<td valign="top">the interaction of the 3 kids is interesting but the background ruins this photo in my opinion.</td>', 'the interaction of the 3 kids is interesting but the background ruins this photo in my opinion.', '2005-04-19 09:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303512, 167336, 35352, '<td valign="top">The blurring doesn''t work for me. I think making the center woman stand out with brightness was sufficient.</td>', 'The blurring doesn''t work for me. I think making the center woman stand out with brightness was sufficient.', '2005-04-19 09:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
