(1303645, 167804, 29797, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait and model, nice and sharp where it needs to be. The only thing that I can think of to improve this (very minor) is maybe cropping more on the left and having more on the right so there''s a tad less negative space behind her. If this is the full frame, just a slight camera pan to the right would do this. But I''m not a pro, and could only wish to capture something like this. Nice job!</td>', 'Lovely portrait and model, nice and sharp where it needs to be. The only thing that I can think of to improve this (very minor) is maybe cropping more on the left and having more on the right so there''s a tad less negative space behind her. If this is the full frame, just a slight camera pan to the right would do this. But I''m not a pro, and could only wish to capture something like this. Nice job!', '2005-04-19 10:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303666, 167358, 33542, '<td valign="top">a bit out of focus... if possible I''d have turned the chair a bit so he wasn''t backlit as much, I think that might have helped the focus</td>', 'a bit out of focus... if possible I''d have turned the chair a bit so he wasn''t backlit as much, I think that might have helped the focus', '2005-04-19 10:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
