(1303852, 167372, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like your timing - that eye through the broken glass is precious. The centred/non-centred composition works reall well - the shape of him in frame is nicely symmetrical, and yet the natural pull of the viewer''s eye tto the subject''s eyes takes one to a strong plane in the image. The thoughfulness, and the direct look you''ve captured is effective too. A man with a truly non-self-cntred view of the world - I like him immediately.</td>', 'Like your timing - that eye through the broken glass is precious. The centred/non-centred composition works reall well - the shape of him in frame is nicely symmetrical, and yet the natural pull of the viewer''s eye tto the subject''s eyes takes one to a strong plane in the image. The thoughfulness, and the direct look you''ve captured is effective too. A man with a truly non-self-cntred view of the world - I like him immediately.', '2005-04-19 11:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303869, 167747, 35739, '<td valign="top">Go Ducks!</td>', 'Go Ducks!', '2005-04-19 11:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303874, 167366, 35472, '<td valign="top">this is one og the best photos I have ever seen, but would you mind to change the name of it:)</td>', 'this is one og the best photos I have ever seen, but would you mind to change the name of it:)', '2005-04-19 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303898, 167707, 4493, '<td valign="top">Seriously? Not sure what you wanted to convey to the voters here. You did meet the challenge, you do have a person in your photo.</td>', 'Seriously? Not sure what you wanted to convey to the voters here. You did meet the challenge, you do have a person in your photo.', '2005-04-19 12:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303910, 167758, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little tighter zoom and catching some action would make the shot a little more interesting.</td>', 'Perhaps a little tighter zoom and catching some action would make the shot a little more interesting.', '2005-04-19 12:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303932, 167360, 4493, '<td valign="top">Motion blur, uninteresting composition, rear view of the subject (no pun intended). Not sure this is the strongest shot you could have submitted. It'' appears you were out with a buddy photographing scenery. Why not ask him to pose in front of something interesting or get his shadow in front of it while he''s composing a shot.</td>', 'Motion blur, uninteresting composition, rear view of the subject (no pun intended). Not sure this is the strongest shot you could have submitted. It'' appears you were out with a buddy photographing scenery. Why not ask him to pose in front of something interesting or get his shadow in front of it while he''s composing a shot.', '2005-04-19 12:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303942, 166784, 35898, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, artistic, and perfectly done (exposure, and other tehnical stuff)! Straight 10!</td>', 'Fantastic, artistic, and perfectly done (exposure, and other tehnical stuff)! Straight 10!', '2005-04-19 12:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303946, 167005, 4493, '<td valign="top">Touching shot, toning is good for this time of shot. Not sure the gaussian blur adds to it though.</td>', 'Touching shot, toning is good for this time of shot. Not sure the gaussian blur adds to it though.', '2005-04-19 12:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303949, 165430, 4493, '<td valign="top">Just a hint of camera shake on this shot. The exposure is very good, and I like the close in composition.</td>', 'Just a hint of camera shake on this shot. The exposure is very good, and I like the close in composition.', '2005-04-19 12:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303957, 167366, 4493, '<td valign="top">Character lines are always great when photographing people. This gentleman has a lot of them. Being this is a candid shot, you had no control over the lighting, but as we all know a shot later in the day with less harsh light would be more appealing. You did well to manage the exposure with the bright afternoon sun.</td>', 'Character lines are always great when photographing people. This gentleman has a lot of them. Being this is a candid shot, you had no control over the lighting, but as we all know a shot later in the day with less harsh light would be more appealing. You did well to manage the exposure with the bright afternoon sun.', '2005-04-19 12:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303968, 167765, 4493, '<td valign="top">Tender moments are great captures. This is nicely done. I may have dodge slightly on the face so it''s not so dark, and the focus seems on the head band and not the eyes.</td>', 'Tender moments are great captures. This is nicely done. I may have dodge slightly on the face so it''s not so dark, and the focus seems on the head band and not the eyes.', '2005-04-19 12:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1303972, 165672, 4493, '<td valign="top">Only thing that I don''t care for too much is the overboard noise reduction used. Everything else is great, even the extremely white whites are ok, because this shot is edgey and expresses a lot of character.</td>', 'Only thing that I don''t care for too much is the overboard noise reduction used. Everything else is great, even the extremely white whites are ok, because this shot is edgey and expresses a lot of character.', '2005-04-19 12:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304071, 167366, 34373, '<td valign="top">What an amazing face!  Great picture!</td>', 'What an amazing face!  Great picture!', '2005-04-19 13:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304197, 167649, 23614, '<td valign="top">I have a picture at home of three of my friends doing the same thing when we went to NYC few years ago!! Very funny. Brought me back some good memories.</td>', 'I have a picture at home of three of my friends doing the same thing when we went to NYC few years ago!! Very funny. Brought me back some good memories.', '2005-04-19 13:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304220, 167578, 23614, '<td valign="top">I would have liked better if the subject was not so centered. Otherwise, very nice picture. I like the lighting and the look.</td>', 'I would have liked better if the subject was not so centered. Otherwise, very nice picture. I like the lighting and the look.', '2005-04-19 13:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304277, 167686, 4493, '<td valign="top">Overall sharpness is lacking. Did you do a post processing sharpening on this after you resized it? A lot of times a light unsharp mask after resize will bring back the original pop you had at full size.</td>', 'Overall sharpness is lacking. Did you do a post processing sharpening on this after you resized it? A lot of times a light unsharp mask after resize will bring back the original pop you had at full size.', '2005-04-19 14:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304283, 166240, 4493, '<td valign="top">Crop is tight, post processing and toning seems a bit extreme, even if you were going for an old west feel. This the only shot you got of him on the horse?</td>', 'Crop is tight, post processing and toning seems a bit extreme, even if you were going for an old west feel. This the only shot you got of him on the horse?', '2005-04-19 14:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304288, 166956, 4493, '<td valign="top">Expressive, maybe a little too much sharpening done to try and recover from soft focus on the eyes, or motion blur from her moving her head. I like the natural expression.</td>', 'Expressive, maybe a little too much sharpening done to try and recover from soft focus on the eyes, or motion blur from her moving her head. I like the natural expression.', '2005-04-19 14:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304298, 167106, 4493, '<td valign="top">A nice moment between mom and daughter. The colors and white balance are done nicely. Unfortunately there is no crop you could have done to remove the straw and keep the overall feel of the shot.</td>', 'A nice moment between mom and daughter. The colors and white balance are done nicely. Unfortunately there is no crop you could have done to remove the straw and keep the overall feel of the shot.', '2005-04-19 14:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304309, 167722, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good exposure on a candid capture. Not sure if it''s motion blur or just DOF falling off, but the camera right side of his face seems soft or blurred. I think overall this will look nice in your family album.</td>', 'Good exposure on a candid capture. Not sure if it''s motion blur or just DOF falling off, but the camera right side of his face seems soft or blurred. I think overall this will look nice in your family album.', '2005-04-19 14:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304317, 167572, 4493, '<td valign="top">Stop, point, click...<br/> <br/>Is there more to this that I am missing? Was this shot for the challenge or for your vacation photo album? As a challenge entry it is lacking in composition, lighting, and exposure. I''m sure you will look fondly back on the day at the beach, but for a challenge site, this image is missing elements that will make it stronger in the eyes of the voters.</td>', 'Stop, point, click... Is there more to this that I am missing? Was this shot for the challenge or for your vacation photo album? As a challenge entry it is lacking in composition, lighting, and exposure. I''m sure you will look fondly back on the day at the beach, but for a challenge site, this image is missing elements that will make it stronger in the eyes of the voters.', '2005-04-19 14:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304330, 167746, 4493, '<td valign="top">Prolly a tough choice you had to make on keeping this color or going black and white. I think either treatement would work nicely. Apart from some minor sharpening needing done, this is a fine capture.</td>', 'Prolly a tough choice you had to make on keeping this color or going black and white. I think either treatement would work nicely. Apart from some minor sharpening needing done, this is a fine capture.', '2005-04-19 14:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304338, 167336, 4493, '<td valign="top">Photoshop to make more out of a quick snapshot usually doesn''t work. I know that you probably didn''t plan this shot, and pose them, or you would have removed the walker, the purses and had them more posed. The sepia treament as well as the blur do little to add to the shot.</td>', 'Photoshop to make more out of a quick snapshot usually doesn''t work. I know that you probably didn''t plan this shot, and pose them, or you would have removed the walker, the purses and had them more posed. The sepia treament as well as the blur do little to add to the shot.', '2005-04-19 14:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304387, 167417, 32033, '<td valign="top">Very nice, although a little to soft for my taste</td>', 'Very nice, although a little to soft for my taste', '2005-04-19 14:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304390, 167751, 4493, '<td valign="top">I might do a light dodge on the eyes, but not too much. Very expressive individual.</td>', 'I might do a light dodge on the eyes, but not too much. Very expressive individual.', '2005-04-19 14:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1304396, 167204, 32033, '<td valign="top">the sky is very natural looking</td>', 'the sky is very natural looking', '2005-04-19 14:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
