(1304594, 167802, 5286, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed. Also the yellows and the blues are very well balanced. Just for the composition I give you a 9.</td>', 'Beautifully composed. Also the yellows and the blues are very well balanced. Just for the composition I give you a 9.', '2005-04-19 15:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
