(1305801, 167728, 4493, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was to score this low due to the technical flaws in it, but as I sat here eating my Good &amp; Plenty candys, the story came out and I realized that despite the technical  difficulties presented here, the story makes up for it.</td>', 'My first reaction was to score this low due to the technical flaws in it, but as I sat here eating my Good & Plenty candys, the story came out and I realized that despite the technical  difficulties presented here, the story makes up for it.', '2005-04-19 21:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
