(1305815, 166999, 31815, '<td valign="top">great shot, simplicity at it''s finest</td>', 'great shot, simplicity at it''s finest', '2005-04-19 21:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305825, 167656, 4493, '<td valign="top">Appears he was about to speak, the capture leans on the side of candid. Exposure is good, may concider dodging the eyes a little to bring out their sparkle more.</td>', 'Appears he was about to speak, the capture leans on the side of candid. Exposure is good, may concider dodging the eyes a little to bring out their sparkle more.', '2005-04-19 21:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305843, 167793, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this model is very expressive and just beams in person. This shot however doesn''t show that. The blur and overall flat lighting don''t flatter her. A shot playing to the camera may have the impact needed to show her radiance to the audience.</td>', 'I''m sure this model is very expressive and just beams in person. This shot however doesn''t show that. The blur and overall flat lighting don''t flatter her. A shot playing to the camera may have the impact needed to show her radiance to the audience.', '2005-04-19 21:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305884, 167765, 6306, '<td valign="top">She looks beautiful.</td>', 'She looks beautiful.', '2005-04-19 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305892, 167591, 4493, '<td valign="top">The scene is nice, maybe just a bit too much post processing.</td>', 'The scene is nice, maybe just a bit too much post processing.', '2005-04-19 21:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305894, 167802, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you didn''t decide to do a selective desaturation on this with just the steps as yellow. For the shooting conditions you manages the exposure very well. This is a fun little shot.</td>', 'I''m glad you didn''t decide to do a selective desaturation on this with just the steps as yellow. For the shooting conditions you manages the exposure very well. This is a fun little shot.', '2005-04-19 21:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305903, 167658, 4493, '<td valign="top">This man does not appear to have wanted his photo taken. His body language does not invite the viewer into your shot. Not knowing who Colvin is, this shot may not have appeal outside the circle of people who know who the model/Colvin is. The b/w treatment may be a little low in contrast as well as some blur on the subjects head.</td>', 'This man does not appear to have wanted his photo taken. His body language does not invite the viewer into your shot. Not knowing who Colvin is, this shot may not have appeal outside the circle of people who know who the model/Colvin is. The b/w treatment may be a little low in contrast as well as some blur on the subjects head.', '2005-04-19 21:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305906, 167725, 4493, '<td valign="top">Chicago is, my kind of town.... :-)<br/> <br/>People seem to be a minor part of your shot. The leading line is nice, but overall the candid/snapshot feel of this image doesn''t probably have mass appeal for a challenge site.</td>', 'Chicago is, my kind of town.... :-) People seem to be a minor part of your shot. The leading line is nice, but overall the candid/snapshot feel of this image doesn''t probably have mass appeal for a challenge site.', '2005-04-19 21:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305910, 167234, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perfection! I love shots like this. Ones where you catch one person doing something other than what everyone else is doing. Not only is she looking down, but her flower is different as well. Great capture!</td>', 'Perfection! I love shots like this. Ones where you catch one person doing something other than what everyone else is doing. Not only is she looking down, but her flower is different as well. Great capture!', '2005-04-19 21:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305913, 167742, 4493, '<td valign="top">Rules of thirds is present, but the overall composition and feel of the shot doesn''t have a lot to move the viewer. We have no connection to these people and what they''re doing.</td>', 'Rules of thirds is present, but the overall composition and feel of the shot doesn''t have a lot to move the viewer. We have no connection to these people and what they''re doing.', '2005-04-19 21:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305914, 167581, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very nice post processing here. The way the baby is looking down with the bear next to him is just too precious.</td>', 'Very nice post processing here. The way the baby is looking down with the bear next to him is just too precious.', '2005-04-19 21:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305919, 167781, 4493, '<td valign="top">Heh, this will be a fun shot to pull out for her first boyfriend to see ;-)<br/> <br/>I like the overall composition and feel here. Nice candid moment that doesn''t feel like a snapshot.</td>', 'Heh, this will be a fun shot to pull out for her first boyfriend to see ;-) I like the overall composition and feel here. Nice candid moment that doesn''t feel like a snapshot.', '2005-04-19 21:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305925, 167649, 4493, '<td valign="top">Well... that''s a position I''m not sure I''d want to be in. The appear to be having fun with it.</td>', 'Well... that''s a position I''m not sure I''d want to be in. The appear to be having fun with it.', '2005-04-19 21:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305940, 167213, 4493, '<td valign="top">Hard shooting at this time of day, that couple with the runners running away from the camera makes for a difficult shot for the viewer to connect with.</td>', 'Hard shooting at this time of day, that couple with the runners running away from the camera makes for a difficult shot for the viewer to connect with.', '2005-04-19 21:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305943, 167618, 4493, '<td valign="top">This is a gem! The look right at the camera, the head tilt of the female, the grain and tone, all just make this a very great capture.</td>', 'This is a gem! The look right at the camera, the head tilt of the female, the grain and tone, all just make this a very great capture.', '2005-04-19 21:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305948, 167393, 4493, '<td valign="top">Two words, FILL FLASH. When you are shooting outdoors and your subject is backlit like these two, you need to throw light back at them. The dark shadows distract from their appearance and make the shot less than what it could be.</td>', 'Two words, FILL FLASH. When you are shooting outdoors and your subject is backlit like these two, you need to throw light back at them. The dark shadows distract from their appearance and make the shot less than what it could be.', '2005-04-19 21:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305956, 166176, 4493, '<td valign="top">While I can appreciate the whimsy you''re going for, the overall dynamic range is more than your camera can capture. To maintain the shadow you sacrificed the whites, to keep the whites, you''d lose the shadows. This being a natural light shot, some sort of reflector on camera right would bring your dynamic range down and possible keep both the shadow and whites in check. The color seems ok, but may be a little on the red side. I also have looked at it with 3 monitors and on all of them the image appears oversharpened.</td>', 'While I can appreciate the whimsy you''re going for, the overall dynamic range is more than your camera can capture. To maintain the shadow you sacrificed the whites, to keep the whites, you''d lose the shadows. This being a natural light shot, some sort of reflector on camera right would bring your dynamic range down and possible keep both the shadow and whites in check. The color seems ok, but may be a little on the red side. I also have looked at it with 3 monitors and on all of them the image appears oversharpened.', '2005-04-19 21:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305961, 166702, 4493, '<td valign="top">A bit more space on the right would help balance your composition. The lack of face detail also keeps the viewer from connecting to the subjects.</td>', 'A bit more space on the right would help balance your composition. The lack of face detail also keeps the viewer from connecting to the subjects.', '2005-04-19 21:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305975, 167339, 4493, '<td valign="top">While it''s not a great shot, I also can''t think of anything to suggest to make it stronger. The selective desat of the image works... I wonder if you actually went against rules and put the subject dead center in the frame if that would be stronger... hrm</td>', 'While it''s not a great shot, I also can''t think of anything to suggest to make it stronger. The selective desat of the image works... I wonder if you actually went against rules and put the subject dead center in the frame if that would be stronger... hrm', '2005-04-19 21:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1305978, 165255, 4493, '<td valign="top">Against what you read about portraits this is a profile that really works! The light, the black background and colors really pop. I like this study. Good work.</td>', 'Against what you read about portraits this is a profile that really works! The light, the black background and colors really pop. I like this study. Good work.', '2005-04-19 21:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
