(1309167, 167153, 17722, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of ages, however I would have scored this higher if a couple of things were different - <br/>The older person should have been holding the baby''s hand in a way that would make it look as if they were walking in the same direction. Had they been on the same plane then the elder''s arm would have looked crisper and more in focus, which I saw as another issue. Finally, I would have had the baby looking up towards the other person or off and away, but not into the camera. In addition to liking the contrast I liked that the background could not be seen &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I love the contrast of ages, however I would have scored this higher if a couple of things were different - The older person should have been holding the baby''s hand in a way that would make it look as if they were walking in the same direction. Had they been on the same plane then the elder''s arm would have looked crisper and more in focus, which I saw as another issue. Finally, I would have had the baby looking up towards the other person or off and away, but not into the camera. In addition to liking the contrast I liked that the background could not be seen <5>', '2005-04-20 20:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
