(1311429, 165255, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Makes this a moving image. I also like the placement of the subject moving him to the right and his profile to the center. Excellent work.</td>', 'Great lighting. Makes this a moving image. I also like the placement of the subject moving him to the right and his profile to the center. Excellent work.', '2005-04-21 17:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311431, 166341, 22046, '<td valign="top">This one really draws the eye to his great mouth. I love the lighting on his face. I wish I could see just a bit of his other eye though. I wonder if another light source from his left would have made this even better?</td>', 'This one really draws the eye to his great mouth. I love the lighting on his face. I wish I could see just a bit of his other eye though. I wonder if another light source from his left would have made this even better?', '2005-04-21 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311433, 167339, 22046, '<td valign="top">The isolated color of the guitar works well in this.</td>', 'The isolated color of the guitar works well in this.', '2005-04-21 17:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311435, 167143, 22046, '<td valign="top">Masterful. The color is perfect. The model is beautiful and moody. The lighting is ideal. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Masterful. The color is perfect. The model is beautiful and moody. The lighting is ideal. One of my top picks.', '2005-04-21 17:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311436, 166474, 22046, '<td valign="top">Sweet portrait. Like the colors and the look on her face.</td>', 'Sweet portrait. Like the colors and the look on her face.', '2005-04-21 17:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311439, 167548, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great color in this. Love her rosy skin, her great blue eyes and the dress and background bringing out the red in her hair. It''s also nice to see a portrait of a beutiful woman who is not still a child. Very nice work here.</td>', 'Great color in this. Love her rosy skin, her great blue eyes and the dress and background bringing out the red in her hair. It''s also nice to see a portrait of a beutiful woman who is not still a child. Very nice work here.', '2005-04-21 17:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311441, 167610, 22046, '<td valign="top">Love this. The composition is perfect, pulling the eye of the viewer to the eyes of the lady. And what wonderful eyes they are. Beautiful!</td>', 'Love this. The composition is perfect, pulling the eye of the viewer to the eyes of the lady. And what wonderful eyes they are. Beautiful!', '2005-04-21 17:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
