(1311556, 167615, 20018, '<td valign="top">I like the idea...model could be great but the light here looks really wrong...too bright, additionally it seems like her face is out of focus</td>', 'I like the idea...model could be great but the light here looks really wrong...too bright, additionally it seems like her face is out of focus', '2005-04-21 18:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311561, 167617, 20018, '<td valign="top">great perspective but the overall setting/background and subjects just don''t do a whole lot for me.  The lighting is pretty evil too.  Try working closer to the golden hours (1 hour in morning/evening while sun is going up and coming down) on more cloudy days.</td>', 'great perspective but the overall setting/background and subjects just don''t do a whole lot for me.  The lighting is pretty evil too.  Try working closer to the golden hours (1 hour in morning/evening while sun is going up and coming down) on more cloudy days.', '2005-04-21 18:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311562, 167834, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is what I call people!!  Nice capture of a great looking family! :) 9</td>', 'This is what I call people!!  Nice capture of a great looking family! :) 9', '2005-04-21 18:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311566, 167695, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice...couldn''t you find some twins :P ????</td>', 'nice...couldn''t you find some twins :P ????', '2005-04-21 18:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311636, 167213, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice little capture. Halos around the kids are quite prominent though (shadow/highlight?).</td>', 'Nice little capture. Halos around the kids are quite prominent though (shadow/highlight?).', '2005-04-21 19:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311638, 167706, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice, but not enough fill light on face to get the emotional aspect very well. To be honest, I don''t feel much about this as it is so clearly staged and ''stock photo'' like - so I don''t connect with it on an emotional level. I do like that wall though.</td>', 'Nice, but not enough fill light on face to get the emotional aspect very well. To be honest, I don''t feel much about this as it is so clearly staged and ''stock photo'' like - so I don''t connect with it on an emotional level. I do like that wall though.', '2005-04-21 19:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311641, 167125, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good viewpoint and subject. Crop on left is a touch awkward.</td>', 'Good viewpoint and subject. Crop on left is a touch awkward.', '2005-04-21 19:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311644, 167766, 31213, '<td valign="top">A bit dark on her face.  Well composed though.</td>', 'A bit dark on her face.  Well composed though.', '2005-04-21 19:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311646, 167332, 31213, '<td valign="top">LOVE the perspective.  Very original.  Not another like it in the challenge so far.</td>', 'LOVE the perspective.  Very original.  Not another like it in the challenge so far.', '2005-04-21 19:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311649, 166933, 31213, '<td valign="top">Her eye is slightly out of focus.  Nicely composed.  I like the bibrant colors and the cute young freshness from your model.  Warms me up inside.</td>', 'Her eye is slightly out of focus.  Nicely composed.  I like the bibrant colors and the cute young freshness from your model.  Warms me up inside.', '2005-04-21 19:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311653, 167660, 10261, '<td valign="top">The blue blur in the bottom left corner is rather distracting. It looks like you couldn''t have cropped it out easily, but you might have been able to reduce it''s prominence by desaturating the blue channel. The angle of the model''s head is a bit odd, but otherwise a good image.</td>', 'The blue blur in the bottom left corner is rather distracting. It looks like you couldn''t have cropped it out easily, but you might have been able to reduce it''s prominence by desaturating the blue channel. The angle of the model''s head is a bit odd, but otherwise a good image.', '2005-04-21 19:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311655, 166481, 31213, '<td valign="top">Okay....with a small "kicker" light, or back light this could ahve been a fantastic image.  Have a small back light helps separate your subject from the background, which is something this image definately needs to be killer.</td>', 'Okay....with a small "kicker" light, or back light this could ahve been a fantastic image.  Have a small back light helps separate your subject from the background, which is something this image definately needs to be killer.', '2005-04-21 19:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311658, 167418, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the clarity on your subject with the motion blur of the foot of someone walking by behind him.  Nice job!</td>', 'Love the clarity on your subject with the motion blur of the foot of someone walking by behind him.  Nice job!', '2005-04-21 19:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311662, 167363, 31213, '<td valign="top">A+ on the composition.  Lighting seems a little flat.  Must have been an overcast day.  Nice candid nevertheless.</td>', 'A+ on the composition.  Lighting seems a little flat.  Must have been an overcast day.  Nice candid nevertheless.', '2005-04-21 19:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311664, 167596, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that this would be a stronger image (particularly for the current challenge) if the people were the focus rather than the shirts.</td>', 'I think that this would be a stronger image (particularly for the current challenge) if the people were the focus rather than the shirts.', '2005-04-21 19:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311665, 166325, 10261, '<td valign="top">Was this staged? Nice shot.</td>', 'Was this staged? Nice shot.', '2005-04-21 19:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311668, 167177, 31213, '<td valign="top">Ahh....an image that puts off an emotion.  Some pics I''ve been flipping through don''t tuoch me emotionally at all.  With this image, however, you can "feel" the energy from the youth of your subjects.  I think you did a great job.  It''s not oversaturated, exposure seems a tiny bit hot, but not distracting.  My complaint is the cluttered feel of the composition.  There almost too much going on.  If the distracting trees weren''t int he background, this would have been easier to look at.  Picture the same image with a blue sky replacing the wispy trees. mmm.<br/> <br/> <br/>Nice job anyways!  You worked with the conditions that were available and caught a great candid shot to share with us.<br/> <br/>Goodluck and happy shooting,<br/> <br/>Chris A</td>', 'Ahh....an image that puts off an emotion.  Some pics I''ve been flipping through don''t tuoch me emotionally at all.  With this image, however, you can "feel" the energy from the youth of your subjects.  I think you did a great job.  It''s not oversaturated, exposure seems a tiny bit hot, but not distracting.  My complaint is the cluttered feel of the composition.  There almost too much going on.  If the distracting trees weren''t int he background, this would have been easier to look at.  Picture the same image with a blue sky replacing the wispy trees. mmm.  Nice job anyways!  You worked with the conditions that were available and caught a great candid shot to share with us. Goodluck and happy shooting, Chris A', '2005-04-21 19:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311670, 166248, 31213, '<td valign="top">I feel the attitude from the girl.  Nice job</td>', 'I feel the attitude from the girl.  Nice job', '2005-04-21 19:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311671, 167828, 31213, '<td valign="top">Those photographers....they''re sneaky people!  :))  Nice shot.</td>', 'Those photographers....they''re sneaky people!  :))  Nice shot.', '2005-04-21 19:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311674, 167143, 8860, '<td valign="top">As ever, the direct look into the camera is powerful, but I don''t know much about this girl from the photo. Yes, she''s lovely to look at, but I get no emotion for the shot. Of course the composition is technically sound but I feel that I would gain more from viewing her candidly, going about her business, unaware of the intrusion into her world.<br/> <br/>On a technical point (apart from your obvious ability) the shot is way over sharpened or NeatImaged (it''s very noisy around the eyebrows) but I love the colour. Not sure about the title.</td>', 'As ever, the direct look into the camera is powerful, but I don''t know much about this girl from the photo. Yes, she''s lovely to look at, but I get no emotion for the shot. Of course the composition is technically sound but I feel that I would gain more from viewing her candidly, going about her business, unaware of the intrusion into her world. On a technical point (apart from your obvious ability) the shot is way over sharpened or NeatImaged (it''s very noisy around the eyebrows) but I love the colour. Not sure about the title.', '2005-04-21 19:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311675, 167585, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image is rather busy. The background does draw the eye toward the intended subject, but a shallower DOF would have helped to reduce many of the distractors.</td>', 'This image is rather busy. The background does draw the eye toward the intended subject, but a shallower DOF would have helped to reduce many of the distractors.', '2005-04-21 19:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311677, 167538, 31213, '<td valign="top">This is a great image but seems a little dark.  Perhaps if you ahd open up a stop or two or adjusted it a bit lighter in PS, this could ahve been fixed.  Love the candid moment though.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a great image but seems a little dark.  Perhaps if you ahd open up a stop or two or adjusted it a bit lighter in PS, this could ahve been fixed.  Love the candid moment though.  Well done.', '2005-04-21 19:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311678, 167654, 10261, '<td valign="top">Blurry couple occluded by branches</td>', 'Blurry couple occluded by branches', '2005-04-21 19:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311680, 166452, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love how you didn''t clone out every imperpection that your three subjects had.  It keeps them feeling real and tangible.  Great use of foreground and background.  The pink thing in the bottom right courner is the only real distracting element.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'Love how you didn''t clone out every imperpection that your three subjects had.  It keeps them feeling real and tangible.  Great use of foreground and background.  The pink thing in the bottom right courner is the only real distracting element.  Very nice shot.', '2005-04-21 19:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311686, 167542, 31213, '<td valign="top">The complicated background takes our focus off of your subject.  Also the lighting on her seems very flat and lifeless.  If you had taken her and put her in a more interesting lighting environment and maybe made sure the background wasnt so distracting it would have been much better.  Perhaps this was a candid though and you couldnt control these elements.  <br/> <br/>Goodluck,<br/> <br/>Chris A</td>', 'The complicated background takes our focus off of your subject.  Also the lighting on her seems very flat and lifeless.  If you had taken her and put her in a more interesting lighting environment and maybe made sure the background wasnt so distracting it would have been much better.  Perhaps this was a candid though and you couldnt control these elements.   Goodluck, Chris A', '2005-04-21 19:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311688, 167593, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the shot if it didn''t contain fragments of mom</td>', 'I would have preferred the shot if it didn''t contain fragments of mom', '2005-04-21 19:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311691, 167256, 31213, '<td valign="top">GREAT focus and tones.  Love the color and vivid blacks.  One of my favorites so far!  The contrasting expressions between the old man and the kid couldn''t have been better.  You should finish high!</td>', 'GREAT focus and tones.  Love the color and vivid blacks.  One of my favorites so far!  The contrasting expressions between the old man and the kid couldn''t have been better.  You should finish high!', '2005-04-21 19:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311694, 166909, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very sharp focus.  Love the expression and composition.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very sharp focus.  Love the expression and composition.  Nice work.', '2005-04-21 19:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311696, 167585, 31213, '<td valign="top">Poor spelling in your title.  Looks like a snapshot.  The composition could be stronger as well as a more interesting camera angle.  Point, shoot, submit.  Don''t expect a ribbon.</td>', 'Poor spelling in your title.  Looks like a snapshot.  The composition could be stronger as well as a more interesting camera angle.  Point, shoot, submit.  Don''t expect a ribbon.', '2005-04-21 19:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311697, 167418, 10261, '<td valign="top">The implied line running from the blurry shoe through the seam in the pavement and on through the wrinkles in his sleeves, though probably unintentional, might have been used creatively to your advantage.<br/></td>', 'The implied line running from the blurry shoe through the seam in the pavement and on through the wrinkles in his sleeves, though probably unintentional, might have been used creatively to your advantage.', '2005-04-21 19:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311701, 165678, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Creative title and interesting capture.</td>', 'Very cool.  Creative title and interesting capture.', '2005-04-21 19:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311703, 167153, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that this would have been stronger if it only included the hands.</td>', 'I think that this would have been stronger if it only included the hands.', '2005-04-21 19:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1311706, 167352, 31213, '<td valign="top">Little darka nd out of focus....but interesting photo nevertheless.</td>', 'Little darka nd out of focus....but interesting photo nevertheless.', '2005-04-21 19:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
