(1311749, 167290, 10261, '<td valign="top">"Watch in amazement as I identify all of the things caught in my beard..."<br/> <br/>The color doesn''t seem to add anything to the image, and I think that B&amp;W would have emphasized the interesting textures.</td>', '"Watch in amazement as I identify all of the things caught in my beard..." The color doesn''t seem to add anything to the image, and I think that B&W would have emphasized the interesting textures.', '2005-04-21 20:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
