(1311757, 167828, 10261, '<td valign="top">The way this is framed emphasizes the car. A narrower crop, more headroom for the photographer and a bit of motion blur on the car might have shifted attention toward the guy in the background.</td>', 'The way this is framed emphasizes the car. A narrower crop, more headroom for the photographer and a bit of motion blur on the car might have shifted attention toward the guy in the background.', '2005-04-21 20:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
