(1312987, 167746, 6814, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on his face.  The skin tones are excellent and the overall mood is very pleasing.  Nice job.</td>', 'I love the expression on his face.  The skin tones are excellent and the overall mood is very pleasing.  Nice job.', '2005-04-22 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312990, 167336, 15919, '<td valign="top">Not very effective blurr effect for my opinon.  This should have been done much more carefully or simply use some other setup.  Actually I think this could have been nice image without the blurr.</td>', 'Not very effective blurr effect for my opinon.  This should have been done much more carefully or simply use some other setup.  Actually I think this could have been nice image without the blurr.', '2005-04-22 10:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312992, 167781, 6814, '<td valign="top">Oh my God, it''s a naked child!!!   &lt;kidding!!&gt;  Very cute picture.  The contrast and lighting are handled well.</td>', 'Oh my God, it''s a naked child!!!   <kidding!!>  Very cute picture.  The contrast and lighting are handled well.', '2005-04-22 10:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312993, 165750, 15919, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective portrait.  Nice light.</td>', 'Simple and effective portrait.  Nice light.', '2005-04-22 10:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312996, 167649, 30018, '<td valign="top">Hope that bull doesn''t decide its time to do his business.  Personally this is a silly vacation shot, in my eyes, and for me, really doesn''t work in this challenge. &lt;2&gt;</td>', 'Hope that bull doesn''t decide its time to do his business.  Personally this is a silly vacation shot, in my eyes, and for me, really doesn''t work in this challenge. <2>', '2005-04-22 10:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312998, 167835, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good capture and you´ve positioned your self very well wich makes the composition very good (persons and shadows).  The sepia tone fits very well here.</td>', 'Good capture and you´ve positioned your self very well wich makes the composition very good (persons and shadows).  The sepia tone fits very well here.', '2005-04-22 10:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313000, 167810, 30018, '<td valign="top">Seems to me to be a vacation shot.  Not really a good shot for this challenge.</td>', 'Seems to me to be a vacation shot.  Not really a good shot for this challenge.', '2005-04-22 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313005, 166481, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice experiment and the face is well lit.  Took me a litle time to figure out the box and I think maybe there is to much negative space.  Also I think that the face is litle to much sharpened.  Fine image though.</td>', 'Nice experiment and the face is well lit.  Took me a litle time to figure out the box and I think maybe there is to much negative space.  Also I think that the face is litle to much sharpened.  Fine image though.', '2005-04-22 10:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313009, 166694, 8624, '<td valign="top">centered subject works nicely in this image</td>', 'centered subject works nicely in this image', '2005-04-22 10:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313012, 167711, 15919, '<td valign="top">Not very creative or original for my opionon.  The framing could be much better done.  Also there seems to be a litle purple fringe.</td>', 'Not very creative or original for my opionon.  The framing could be much better done.  Also there seems to be a litle purple fringe.', '2005-04-22 10:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313015, 167670, 30018, '<td valign="top">I love the image, but it seems quite dark and lacking contrast &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I love the image, but it seems quite dark and lacking contrast <5>', '2005-04-22 10:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313017, 167211, 6814, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition with great color.</td>', 'Excellent composition with great color.', '2005-04-22 10:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313018, 166993, 8624, '<td valign="top">amazing sharpness and color. took bad they are not looking into the camera. also, there are some tall grass blades that are distracting in front of the boys. might have been worth it to slightly reposition the subjects or yourself and/or pluck a few out of the way.</td>', 'amazing sharpness and color. took bad they are not looking into the camera. also, there are some tall grass blades that are distracting in front of the boys. might have been worth it to slightly reposition the subjects or yourself and/or pluck a few out of the way.', '2005-04-22 10:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313021, 166871, 6814, '<td valign="top">The detail is washed out of this image with the way that the lighting was done.  This would be a much better shot with a softer lighting scheme.</td>', 'The detail is washed out of this image with the way that the lighting was done.  This would be a much better shot with a softer lighting scheme.', '2005-04-22 10:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313024, 165672, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent black and white image.  The lighting and contrast are very good and the composition is wonderful.</td>', 'This is an excellent black and white image.  The lighting and contrast are very good and the composition is wonderful.', '2005-04-22 10:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313031, 166212, 6814, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait!  I love her eyes and the expression on her face.  The lighting and contrast were handled beautifully.</td>', 'Excellent portrait!  I love her eyes and the expression on her face.  The lighting and contrast were handled beautifully.', '2005-04-22 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313037, 167790, 6814, '<td valign="top">Overall, this is a technically good image, except for the way you angled the camera.  I find the angle to be distracting from an otherwise technically sound photo.</td>', 'Overall, this is a technically good image, except for the way you angled the camera.  I find the angle to be distracting from an otherwise technically sound photo.', '2005-04-22 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313041, 167539, 6814, '<td valign="top">Excellent work to give the impression of hand tinting.  I like the idea and you''ve executed very well.</td>', 'Excellent work to give the impression of hand tinting.  I like the idea and you''ve executed very well.', '2005-04-22 11:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313044, 167593, 6814, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the shadows are a little too distracting.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the shadows are a little too distracting.', '2005-04-22 11:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313047, 166864, 6814, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand what the point of this shot is.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand what the point of this shot is.', '2005-04-22 11:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313051, 167825, 6814, '<td valign="top">This photo definitely put a smile on my face.  Very humorous.</td>', 'This photo definitely put a smile on my face.  Very humorous.', '2005-04-22 11:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313054, 167290, 6814, '<td valign="top">If not for the shadow falling across his face, this would be an excellent photograph.  Next, I would suggest that you wait a few minutes for the sun to change positions so that the shadow doesn''t distract from your image.</td>', 'If not for the shadow falling across his face, this would be an excellent photograph.  Next, I would suggest that you wait a few minutes for the sun to change positions so that the shadow doesn''t distract from your image.', '2005-04-22 11:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313055, 165430, 6814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  The skin tones are excellent and you captured a very appealing expression on her face.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  The skin tones are excellent and you captured a very appealing expression on her face.', '2005-04-22 11:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313062, 167834, 6814, '<td valign="top">The main point of this photo is out of focus.  You want the main subject to be completely in focus, but it looks like she moved at the last moment.</td>', 'The main point of this photo is out of focus.  You want the main subject to be completely in focus, but it looks like she moved at the last moment.', '2005-04-22 11:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313066, 167829, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is a great b&amp;w image.  I like the expression on both of their faces.  The lighting and contrast were handled very well, and the composition was well thought out.  Nice job!</td>', 'This is a great b&w image.  I like the expression on both of their faces.  The lighting and contrast were handled very well, and the composition was well thought out.  Nice job!', '2005-04-22 11:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313067, 167751, 30018, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  I would love to have seen a couple of scouts in the background, out of focus, but there somewhere.  Still a great shot. &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  I would love to have seen a couple of scouts in the background, out of focus, but there somewhere.  Still a great shot. <9>', '2005-04-22 11:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313069, 166341, 6814, '<td valign="top">The lighting is not good for this shot.  I find the deep shadow on the right side of the face to be very distracting.</td>', 'The lighting is not good for this shot.  I find the deep shadow on the right side of the face to be very distracting.', '2005-04-22 11:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313074, 167706, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is another case where the deep shadows on her left side is very distracting.  Lighting changes might make this a better shot.</td>', 'This is another case where the deep shadows on her left side is very distracting.  Lighting changes might make this a better shot.', '2005-04-22 11:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313119, 167543, 33893, '<td valign="top">Were she standing... this title could have been "Outstanding in her field" heehee</td>', 'Were she standing... this title could have been "Outstanding in her field" heehee', '2005-04-22 11:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313133, 167581, 33379, '<td valign="top">i like this capture, back again..this is a really great shot! i wish i knew what he was so occupied with to where he isnt turning around to see what your doing. loved it!</td>', 'i like this capture, back again..this is a really great shot! i wish i knew what he was so occupied with to where he isnt turning around to see what your doing. loved it!', '2005-04-22 11:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313178, 166993, 33893, '<td valign="top">Texas? The bluebonnets made me think so.</td>', 'Texas? The bluebonnets made me think so.', '2005-04-22 12:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313216, 166702, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good composition and colors</td>', 'Good composition and colors', '2005-04-22 12:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313221, 166160, 15919, '<td valign="top">Lovely models but background and light could have been better.</td>', 'Lovely models but background and light could have been better.', '2005-04-22 12:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313294, 165523, 31213, '<td valign="top">This guy has serial killer written all over him.  Scary!</td>', 'This guy has serial killer written all over him.  Scary!', '2005-04-22 13:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313342, 167459, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice  shot,  This could have worked for minimalism as well!!</td>', 'Nice  shot,  This could have worked for minimalism as well!!', '2005-04-22 13:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313397, 166638, 34192, '<td valign="top">reminds me of annie leibovitz.  Good job - not the usual people shot in this challenge. bumping to 9.</td>', 'reminds me of annie leibovitz.  Good job - not the usual people shot in this challenge. bumping to 9.', '2005-04-22 14:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313424, 167306, 25787, '<td valign="top">So is my son.</td>', 'So is my son.', '2005-04-22 14:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313427, 167610, 29269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! <br/>Improvement suggestions: image is too hot on the left side. I would not crop it though as the composition is perfect as it stands right now. Perhaps a slight curve adjustment would have helped.<br/>Eyes - there is a light reflection in the retinas - something you could have tried to ameliorate by cloning or burning...<br/>Still think that this will end up in top 10%.</td>', 'Beautiful! Improvement suggestions: image is too hot on the left side. I would not crop it though as the composition is perfect as it stands right now. Perhaps a slight curve adjustment would have helped.Eyes - there is a light reflection in the retinas - something you could have tried to ameliorate by cloning or burning...Still think that this will end up in top 10%.', '2005-04-22 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313440, 167079, 29269, '<td valign="top">I like the overall darker tone of the image, but I don''t think I can find a good reason for the ladder in the picture. (both the actual one and the reflection in the mirror).<br/>Even if the all was left was a negative space, it would have been better.<br/>Still one of my top 10% picks for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the overall darker tone of the image, but I don''t think I can find a good reason for the ladder in the picture. (both the actual one and the reflection in the mirror).Even if the all was left was a negative space, it would have been better.Still one of my top 10% picks for this challenge.', '2005-04-22 14:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313445, 167735, 29269, '<td valign="top">They really look angry. Excellent capture. The outside shot done at or near the middle of the day though - sun casts unwanted shadows on people''s faces. Not much could be done with basic editing though.<br/>Good luck!<br/>Edit: This is an advanced editing challenge. Still like the image though.</td>', 'They really look angry. Excellent capture. The outside shot done at or near the middle of the day though - sun casts unwanted shadows on people''s faces. Not much could be done with basic editing though.Good luck!Edit: This is an advanced editing challenge. Still like the image though.', '2005-04-22 14:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313453, 167547, 29269, '<td valign="top">I think that this is the winner. Excellent capture, great colors! Good DOF with all children pretty much in focus, at the same time crisp image done with fast shutter.<br/>Technically superb, very nice composition, 10 from me.</td>', 'I think that this is the winner. Excellent capture, great colors! Good DOF with all children pretty much in focus, at the same time crisp image done with fast shutter.Technically superb, very nice composition, 10 from me.', '2005-04-22 14:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313459, 165890, 9821, '<td valign="top">intimate moment ... well captured</td>', 'intimate moment ... well captured', '2005-04-22 14:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313461, 167781, 9821, '<td valign="top">funny ... great job ... 10</td>', 'funny ... great job ... 10', '2005-04-22 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313464, 166638, 9821, '<td valign="top">the burning around the edges is a little too obvious, but it''s still great ... 10</td>', 'the burning around the edges is a little too obvious, but it''s still great ... 10', '2005-04-22 14:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313465, 166438, 9821, '<td valign="top">great light ... 10</td>', 'great light ... 10', '2005-04-22 14:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313467, 165601, 9821, '<td valign="top">excellent work again, john ... another 10</td>', 'excellent work again, john ... another 10', '2005-04-22 14:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313468, 167547, 9821, '<td valign="top">perfect ... 10</td>', 'perfect ... 10', '2005-04-22 14:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313469, 167425, 29269, '<td valign="top">Something looks weird with his right hand - did he have a baton? If he had, it should not have been desaturated IMO/ if he hadn''t it looks like his hand is detached from the body.<br/>Otherwise a good use of selective desaturation, as it makes the runner stand out whereas otherwise he would blend in with the background crowd.</td>', 'Something looks weird with his right hand - did he have a baton? If he had, it should not have been desaturated IMO/ if he hadn''t it looks like his hand is detached from the body.Otherwise a good use of selective desaturation, as it makes the runner stand out whereas otherwise he would blend in with the background crowd.', '2005-04-22 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
