(1313971, 166176, 31213, '<td valign="top">You oversharpened this image in post.  Very grainy and gritty.  If you had ran Neat Image or just did less with the sharpening, it could have been decent.  At least the lighting is pleasant<br/></td>', 'You oversharpened this image in post.  Very grainy and gritty.  If you had ran Neat Image or just did less with the sharpening, it could have been decent.  At least the lighting is pleasant', '2005-04-22 18:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313983, 167539, 31213, '<td valign="top">Kinda creepy.  Perhaps a bit overprocessed....even though this is probably what you were going for.  I think that toning the blue down a bit, stopping down a bit (to get a little more detail in the cheeks), and also having your model look at the camera would have made it much more powerful.   Just my two cents.  Cute kid and nice crop.</td>', 'Kinda creepy.  Perhaps a bit overprocessed....even though this is probably what you were going for.  I think that toning the blue down a bit, stopping down a bit (to get a little more detail in the cheeks), and also having your model look at the camera would have made it much more powerful.   Just my two cents.  Cute kid and nice crop.', '2005-04-22 18:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313985, 167217, 31213, '<td valign="top">Aside from the God aweful lighting, you have a very interesting subject and composition.  I like it.  The uniform background provides great contrast to the red hair.</td>', 'Aside from the God aweful lighting, you have a very interesting subject and composition.  I like it.  The uniform background provides great contrast to the red hair.', '2005-04-22 18:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
