(1314429, 165601, 18191, '<td valign="top">As I have previously stated, I believe this to be one of your best and most captivating portraits. Good work... would like to see some of your comments after the challenge is over.</td>', 'As I have previously stated, I believe this to be one of your best and most captivating portraits. Good work... would like to see some of your comments after the challenge is over.', '2005-04-22 23:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314441, 167279, 32997, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is one beautiful shot!</td>', 'Wow, this is one beautiful shot!', '2005-04-22 23:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314450, 167826, 28141, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about this use of partial desat.  To make that technique effective, it needs to highlight an essential element or something that really adds to the image.  It might work if it were just the flip flops, but the writing on their shirts is overkill.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about this use of partial desat.  To make that technique effective, it needs to highlight an essential element or something that really adds to the image.  It might work if it were just the flip flops, but the writing on their shirts is overkill.', '2005-04-22 23:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314453, 165669, 28141, '<td valign="top">Seems a tad oversharp.</td>', 'Seems a tad oversharp.', '2005-04-22 23:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314454, 167547, 32997, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful shot-I would love to see a cropped version, with less sand and more sky..or even half the way up, with just the 1st two pairs, and only a hint of sand..well done on this one!</td>', 'Really wonderful shot-I would love to see a cropped version, with less sand and more sky..or even half the way up, with just the 1st two pairs, and only a hint of sand..well done on this one!', '2005-04-22 23:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314458, 167805, 28141, '<td valign="top">I like the kid on the shoulders in the sea of people concept, but the blurry guy on the left in the foreground is really distracting.</td>', 'I like the kid on the shoulders in the sea of people concept, but the blurry guy on the left in the foreground is really distracting.', '2005-04-22 23:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314465, 165523, 32997, '<td valign="top">Fascinating study of an individual..great capture, eyes are wild..focus seems a bit soft on the face. Overall nice job.</td>', 'Fascinating study of an individual..great capture, eyes are wild..focus seems a bit soft on the face. Overall nice job.', '2005-04-22 23:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314470, 167831, 32997, '<td valign="top">I really like how you have captured a moment-there is real humanity in this shot..well done.</td>', 'I really like how you have captured a moment-there is real humanity in this shot..well done.', '2005-04-22 23:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314473, 166438, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great composition..really like this shot!</td>', 'Great composition..really like this shot!', '2005-04-22 23:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314527, 167559, 9581, '<td valign="top">This is a comical situation... great shot.. 10</td>', 'This is a comical situation... great shot.. 10', '2005-04-23 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314530, 166215, 9581, '<td valign="top">Preciouse little one.. nice soft tones here and the colors are perfect...</td>', 'Preciouse little one.. nice soft tones here and the colors are perfect...', '2005-04-23 00:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314533, 167695, 9581, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2005-04-23 00:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314587, 167583, 29269, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! I''m sure you are talking about the fellow with PDA.. oh wait, the other bald guy has something too!<br/>I like thebackground, reminds me of Niagara falls...<br/>On a serious note this is one of the better photos in this challenge, depicting multiplicity of ages and habits... 8.</td>', 'Fantastic! I''m sure you are talking about the fellow with PDA.. oh wait, the other bald guy has something too!I like thebackground, reminds me of Niagara falls...On a serious note this is one of the better photos in this challenge, depicting multiplicity of ages and habits... 8.', '2005-04-23 00:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
