(1314792, 167584, 31443, '<td valign="top">This photo shows a relaxed atmosphere give you ponts for that but it lacks color and contrast and the trees in the background are blurred</td>', 'This photo shows a relaxed atmosphere give you ponts for that but it lacks color and contrast and the trees in the background are blurred', '2005-04-23 05:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314799, 167194, 31443, '<td valign="top">Great setup with this background and an unusual balance, big people, small mountain, I like it...</td>', 'Great setup with this background and an unusual balance, big people, small mountain, I like it...', '2005-04-23 05:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314803, 165601, 31443, '<td valign="top">Obviously not an ordinary character so this makes a special image...7</td>', 'Obviously not an ordinary character so this makes a special image...7', '2005-04-23 05:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314804, 166949, 31443, '<td valign="top">A meaningful and sweet photo...8</td>', 'A meaningful and sweet photo...8', '2005-04-23 05:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314806, 166408, 28108, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Lighting is terrific, the clothes matches the background. The girl is very cute. If only she didn''t have her purse, would''ve looked like a fasion shot. Nice work!</td>', 'Very nice... Lighting is terrific, the clothes matches the background. The girl is very cute. If only she didn''t have her purse, would''ve looked like a fasion shot. Nice work!', '2005-04-23 05:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314808, 165523, 28108, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. The background works very well. The main subject is a little out of focus. Too bad.</td>', 'I like this picture. The background works very well. The main subject is a little out of focus. Too bad.', '2005-04-23 05:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314809, 166951, 28108, '<td valign="top">Ok, the girl is hot I''ll give you that. But what''s with the two guys backs filling half the picture. The composition is very poor. It looks like a snapshot of a total stranger. If the whole right side of the picture would have been cropped out (leaving the girl in white in the back) it would allready look MUCH better.</td>', 'Ok, the girl is hot I''ll give you that. But what''s with the two guys backs filling half the picture. The composition is very poor. It looks like a snapshot of a total stranger. If the whole right side of the picture would have been cropped out (leaving the girl in white in the back) it would allready look MUCH better.', '2005-04-23 05:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314811, 167722, 28108, '<td valign="top">That''s nice. Beautiful colors, crisp, I love the background and the boy''s expression can''t make me do anything else but smile. Very nice!</td>', 'That''s nice. Beautiful colors, crisp, I love the background and the boy''s expression can''t make me do anything else but smile. Very nice!', '2005-04-23 05:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314813, 167816, 28108, '<td valign="top">That''s a very nice picture with poor resolution. I took a couple of steps away from my screen to avoid that effect and like I said, it''s really a nice portrait.</td>', 'That''s a very nice picture with poor resolution. I took a couple of steps away from my screen to avoid that effect and like I said, it''s really a nice portrait.', '2005-04-23 05:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314814, 167752, 33352, '<td valign="top">Niave little guy, but very good shot</td>', 'Niave little guy, but very good shot', '2005-04-23 05:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314816, 167366, 28108, '<td valign="top">Brilliant black and white. Nice composition, awsome details.</td>', 'Brilliant black and white. Nice composition, awsome details.', '2005-04-23 06:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314818, 167754, 28108, '<td valign="top">Too much shadow, doesn''t really work well with the composition.</td>', 'Too much shadow, doesn''t really work well with the composition.', '2005-04-23 06:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314819, 167567, 33352, '<td valign="top">It Is very hard to photograph a groupe, the backlighting distracts from the main subject, all that aside you have a good atmosphere in the shot, well done</td>', 'It Is very hard to photograph a groupe, the backlighting distracts from the main subject, all that aside you have a good atmosphere in the shot, well done', '2005-04-23 06:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314822, 167809, 33352, '<td valign="top">Interesting toning,and croping, I studied this shot for while,and tried to work out your apeture and decided it must have been wide open and centre balanced,by the blurring behind and on the shirt, Igave an 8 hope I got it right</td>', 'Interesting toning,and croping, I studied this shot for while,and tried to work out your apeture and decided it must have been wide open and centre balanced,by the blurring behind and on the shirt, Igave an 8 hope I got it right', '2005-04-23 06:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314823, 166474, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very Natural finish to this shot, well done.</td>', 'Very Natural finish to this shot, well done.', '2005-04-23 06:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314827, 167804, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo I cut a point, because the forhead is a bit to bright, and distracts a little, 8</td>', 'Very nice photo I cut a point, because the forhead is a bit to bright, and distracts a little, 8', '2005-04-23 06:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314828, 167324, 33352, '<td valign="top">I Believe if you had cropped  the left side in 2.5 cm  you would  still have the effect you are looking for without the distracting backlight, and still given the suject walking room</td>', 'I Believe if you had cropped  the left side in 2.5 cm  you would  still have the effect you are looking for without the distracting backlight, and still given the suject walking room', '2005-04-23 06:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314829, 167650, 33352, '<td valign="top">People over the age of ten are not allowed on these swings,(tongue in cheek)  very good black &amp; white</td>', 'People over the age of ten are not allowed on these swings,(tongue in cheek)  very good black & white', '2005-04-23 06:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314830, 167710, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nice Skin Tone</td>', 'Nice Skin Tone', '2005-04-23 06:32:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1314831, 167811, 33352, '<td valign="top">Great use of light.</td>', 'Great use of light.', '2005-04-23 06:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314835, 165255, 16241, '<td valign="top">great portrait</td>', 'great portrait', '2005-04-23 07:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314836, 167217, 16241, '<td valign="top">hi steve, cool hair :)</td>', 'hi steve, cool hair :)', '2005-04-23 07:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315006, 167213, 31443, '<td valign="top">The title is good and the composition as well or rather the kids made it special, nice overall although some brightness is overdone around the shoes of the kids...</td>', 'The title is good and the composition as well or rather the kids made it special, nice overall although some brightness is overdone around the shoes of the kids...', '2005-04-23 10:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315023, 167437, 28258, '<td valign="top">nice photo. really like the tones and light use.  should ribbon.</td>', 'nice photo. really like the tones and light use.  should ribbon.', '2005-04-23 10:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315046, 167571, 31443, '<td valign="top">Obviously! Very sweet photo...</td>', 'Obviously! Very sweet photo...', '2005-04-23 11:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315057, 167347, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting.</td>', 'Very good lighting.', '2005-04-23 11:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315077, 167670, 31443, '<td valign="top">Not devious enough but ohhh the look of shame LOL :)</td>', 'Not devious enough but ohhh the look of shame LOL :)', '2005-04-23 11:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315174, 166909, 5286, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp focus and good timing, you''ve caught a nice expression! I''m wondering if this would look better in B/W, since the colors are really not doing much for the picture.</td>', 'Nice crisp focus and good timing, you''ve caught a nice expression! I''m wondering if this would look better in B/W, since the colors are really not doing much for the picture.', '2005-04-23 12:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315179, 167532, 5286, '<td valign="top">Nice candid, well composed. Lacks pop somehow for me.. partial selective desaturation might help bring out the subject better. 7.</td>', 'Nice candid, well composed. Lacks pop somehow for me.. partial selective desaturation might help bring out the subject better. 7.', '2005-04-23 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315181, 167402, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, and a very photogenic subject. The framing is very good, the tighness of the crop does a lot for the image. However the eyes are a little dull, you could try dodging the whites and dodging the (very pale) catchlights...it would make it an excellent picture. Good work.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, and a very photogenic subject. The framing is very good, the tighness of the crop does a lot for the image. However the eyes are a little dull, you could try dodging the whites and dodging the (very pale) catchlights...it would make it an excellent picture. Good work.', '2005-04-23 12:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315185, 167530, 5286, '<td valign="top">I''m a little torn about this image. The colors are excellently chosen. I think I would like to see more detail in the subject, which does not (particularly the head and cap) look sharp enough to me. Compositionally, I think placing him a tad more to the left, or better still cropping tighter from the left would add tension to the image. I really like the title you''ve chosen, it fits the atmosphere created by the dark colors!</td>', 'I''m a little torn about this image. The colors are excellently chosen. I think I would like to see more detail in the subject, which does not (particularly the head and cap) look sharp enough to me. Compositionally, I think placing him a tad more to the left, or better still cropping tighter from the left would add tension to the image. I really like the title you''ve chosen, it fits the atmosphere created by the dark colors!', '2005-04-23 12:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315194, 167418, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very poignant; it conveys so much that I wonder if it is even right to comment on technical aspects. But I will :P, I wish the man''s body were not cropped off from the right and bottom. A little more space on the bottom would also add some context...About the passerby I''m not so sure. I started out thinking that he would be better off missing, but on second thoughts, I think he adds to the neglected, passed-by<br/> feel of the subject. Wonder what this looks like in B/W. 7.</td>', 'Very poignant; it conveys so much that I wonder if it is even right to comment on technical aspects. But I will :P, I wish the man''s body were not cropped off from the right and bottom. A little more space on the bottom would also add some context...About the passerby I''m not so sure. I started out thinking that he would be better off missing, but on second thoughts, I think he adds to the neglected, passed-by feel of the subject. Wonder what this looks like in B/W. 7.', '2005-04-23 12:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315238, 167447, 5286, '<td valign="top">Great subject, and very nice colors.But the position of the hands has left the eyes in complete shadow, and the only light is on the tip of the nose. If the hands are placed farther away from the face in the same position, the shadowing wouldn''thappen... Also, I''d try a tighter crops, maybe around the top of the scarf from top, and a little below the chin from the bottom, I think it might help the impact.</td>', 'Great subject, and very nice colors.But the position of the hands has left the eyes in complete shadow, and the only light is on the tip of the nose. If the hands are placed farther away from the face in the same position, the shadowing wouldn''thappen... Also, I''d try a tighter crops, maybe around the top of the scarf from top, and a little below the chin from the bottom, I think it might help the impact.', '2005-04-23 13:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315288, 167353, 25464, '<td valign="top">Perfect placemment, complementary background - not distracting, nice tones, conveys emotion, sharp focus, harsh light but appropriate for the shot.  Excellent.</td>', 'Perfect placemment, complementary background - not distracting, nice tones, conveys emotion, sharp focus, harsh light but appropriate for the shot.  Excellent.', '2005-04-23 13:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315291, 167483, 25464, '<td valign="top">Harsh light seems appropriate.  Very interesting.  Could be taken straight from the movie Gladiator.  Great colors as well.  Nice.</td>', 'Harsh light seems appropriate.  Very interesting.  Could be taken straight from the movie Gladiator.  Great colors as well.  Nice.', '2005-04-23 13:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315294, 167366, 25464, '<td valign="top">Not an overly interesting pose, but the detail is amazing.  You can''t take a photo with this much detail and not convey emotion and character.  Good job.</td>', 'Not an overly interesting pose, but the detail is amazing.  You can''t take a photo with this much detail and not convey emotion and character.  Good job.', '2005-04-23 13:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315317, 167832, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2005-04-23 13:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315494, 167708, 24890, '<td valign="top">The shirts seem overblown. Not sure I like the pink tint that I am getting on this black and white, but then again it may be my monitor. Your daughter is cute! Mom could smile more. 6</td>', 'The shirts seem overblown. Not sure I like the pink tint that I am getting on this black and white, but then again it may be my monitor. Your daughter is cute! Mom could smile more. 6', '2005-04-23 14:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315503, 167816, 24890, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail captivated me on this photo. Then I pull it up and it seems a little overprocessed. 6</td>', 'The thumbnail captivated me on this photo. Then I pull it up and it seems a little overprocessed. 6', '2005-04-23 14:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315506, 166782, 24890, '<td valign="top">Photo is very busy. Maybe a tighter crop would help more. 5</td>', 'Photo is very busy. Maybe a tighter crop would help more. 5', '2005-04-23 14:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315508, 166408, 24890, '<td valign="top">She is really pretty. I think a portrait crop for this would have turned out nice too. 8</td>', 'She is really pretty. I think a portrait crop for this would have turned out nice too. 8', '2005-04-23 14:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315511, 167722, 24890, '<td valign="top">Help Superman....  :)  How cute is he!  8</td>', 'Help Superman....  :)  How cute is he!  8', '2005-04-23 15:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315512, 167542, 24890, '<td valign="top">The background is terribly distracting.  5</td>', 'The background is terribly distracting.  5', '2005-04-23 15:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315516, 167832, 24890, '<td valign="top">OUCH! Thank goodness for the goggles! Excellent photo. I love the tight crop and the determination in her eyes.....  er ..... eye! My highest photo so far. 10</td>', 'OUCH! Thank goodness for the goggles! Excellent photo. I love the tight crop and the determination in her eyes.....  er ..... eye! My highest photo so far. 10', '2005-04-23 15:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315517, 166853, 24890, '<td valign="top">Seems blurry, and I can see some background editing. 7</td>', 'Seems blurry, and I can see some background editing. 7', '2005-04-23 15:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315520, 167610, 24890, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Have the eyes been processed? 7</td>', 'Nice shot. Have the eyes been processed? 7', '2005-04-23 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315522, 166871, 24890, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit too bright... Overexposed.... 6</td>', 'Seems a bit too bright... Overexposed.... 6', '2005-04-23 15:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315524, 167746, 24890, '<td valign="top">Nice thought provoking image. 8</td>', 'Nice thought provoking image. 8', '2005-04-23 15:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315525, 167742, 24890, '<td valign="top">Focus seems way too soft.</td>', 'Focus seems way too soft.', '2005-04-23 15:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315527, 167402, 24890, '<td valign="top">What a cutie! 9</td>', 'What a cutie! 9', '2005-04-23 15:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315529, 167154, 24890, '<td valign="top">Usually I am tired of the color/B&amp;W shots, but this one is very tastefully done. 9</td>', 'Usually I am tired of the color/B&W shots, but this one is very tastefully done. 9', '2005-04-23 15:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315530, 167005, 24890, '<td valign="top">A treasure! 9</td>', 'A treasure! 9', '2005-04-23 15:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315532, 167833, 24890, '<td valign="top">How appropriate is the title for this one! Love the light coming from above this precious model! Gives the impression that she is being looked upon from above. Wonderful shot. I am sure that this picture will be treasured for years to come. 10!!!!</td>', 'How appropriate is the title for this one! Love the light coming from above this precious model! Gives the impression that she is being looked upon from above. Wonderful shot. I am sure that this picture will be treasured for years to come. 10!!!!', '2005-04-23 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315534, 167751, 24890, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Way to go!</td>', 'Great shot. Way to go!', '2005-04-23 15:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315535, 167750, 24890, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model. I don''t think I would hide her behind so many flowers though. Maybe a tighter crop? 8</td>', 'Beautiful model. I don''t think I would hide her behind so many flowers though. Maybe a tighter crop? 8', '2005-04-23 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315536, 167204, 24890, '<td valign="top">Been there. Done that twice!  :)  Nice shot! 7</td>', 'Been there. Done that twice!  :)  Nice shot! 7', '2005-04-23 15:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315537, 167616, 24890, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop could have conveyed the title just as well.... but would have given more "power" to your main subject. 6</td>', 'I think a tighter crop could have conveyed the title just as well.... but would have given more "power" to your main subject. 6', '2005-04-23 15:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315538, 167831, 24890, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and composition.  8</td>', 'Interesting shot and composition.  8', '2005-04-23 15:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315542, 166784, 24890, '<td valign="top">Powerful Shot.... Deserves a ribbon. My only quirk is that the picture seems to have a lot of gray to it. If this was set up a grungy white shirt might have helped.... If this wasn''t set up, you did the image justice. 10</td>', 'Powerful Shot.... Deserves a ribbon. My only quirk is that the picture seems to have a lot of gray to it. If this was set up a grungy white shirt might have helped.... If this wasn''t set up, you did the image justice. 10', '2005-04-23 15:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315543, 167594, 24890, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle to this shot. 8</td>', 'Interesting angle to this shot. 8', '2005-04-23 15:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1315546, 167106, 24890, '<td valign="top">What a sweet, story-telling image. 8</td>', 'What a sweet, story-telling image. 8', '2005-04-23 15:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
