(1316936, 167139, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lucky you, getting tickets! This is also an advantage of a PAS camera (or was it an SLR??)<br/> <br/>Shame you couldn''t have caught him i a less silly pose, with a clear view of Roger. Good, clear snap though.</td>', 'Lucky you, getting tickets! This is also an advantage of a PAS camera (or was it an SLR??) Shame you couldn''t have caught him i a less silly pose, with a clear view of Roger. Good, clear snap though.', '2005-04-24 04:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316938, 166548, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well-suited to the title.<br/>I had look closely here as I initially thought you added a border on only part of it. I see it isn''t - it''s part of the background.<br/>Well seen &amp; composed/exposed. (7)</td>', 'Well-suited to the title.I had look closely here as I initially thought you added a border on only part of it. I see it isn''t - it''s part of the background.Well seen & composed/exposed. (7)', '2005-04-24 04:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
