(1316964, 167528, 31443, '<td valign="top">The subject of your image is good but I really dislike the frame this way, a simple frame is nicer imo...</td>', 'The subject of your image is good but I really dislike the frame this way, a simple frame is nicer imo...', '2005-04-24 04:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316966, 166638, 34247, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting and color tone. 10</td>', 'Like the lighting and color tone. 10', '2005-04-24 04:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316967, 167153, 16790, '<td valign="top">The composition here is great - the photo is both adorable and touching.  I do have a couple of suggestions, though.  I think the crop is just a tad too close, particularly on the left side, where the knuckles are being cut out; also, it looks as if the background was blackened, and this is very apparent on the older arm.  I would also suggest working a bit on the colour or simply going black and white with this; the colours really don''t do this cute baby justice!  The DOF is just a bit off, as the top of the arm is blurry.  Nonetheless, I like the way this shot is lit for the most part, and some minor editing would really make it pop.  Nice effort!</td>', 'The composition here is great - the photo is both adorable and touching.  I do have a couple of suggestions, though.  I think the crop is just a tad too close, particularly on the left side, where the knuckles are being cut out; also, it looks as if the background was blackened, and this is very apparent on the older arm.  I would also suggest working a bit on the colour or simply going black and white with this; the colours really don''t do this cute baby justice!  The DOF is just a bit off, as the top of the arm is blurry.  Nonetheless, I like the way this shot is lit for the most part, and some minor editing would really make it pop.  Nice effort!', '2005-04-24 04:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316968, 167802, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice framing. 7</td>', 'Nice framing. 7', '2005-04-24 04:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316969, 167343, 16790, '<td valign="top">Clever title for an excellent black and white image.  The tones are great in this - I see true blacks and whites, with no detail lost.  Nice work.</td>', 'Clever title for an excellent black and white image.  The tones are great in this - I see true blacks and whites, with no detail lost.  Nice work.', '2005-04-24 04:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316970, 167735, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is adorable - you''ve captured quite the array of expressions, and I love the colours.  It''d be nice if this weren''t cropped quite so tight, and the lighting is not quite ideal, but this is still a sharp, interesting picture.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is adorable - you''ve captured quite the array of expressions, and I love the colours.  It''d be nice if this weren''t cropped quite so tight, and the lighting is not quite ideal, but this is still a sharp, interesting picture.  Nice job.', '2005-04-24 04:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316972, 167658, 31443, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew what the message of this image is? I like the overall shot though...7</td>', 'I wish I knew what the message of this image is? I like the overall shot though...7', '2005-04-24 04:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316974, 167571, 16790, '<td valign="top">I like this portrait - the black and white works well here, and the woman''s eyes really seem to twinkle.  Nice sharpness (maybe a tad too much, but it works for b&amp;w), and I like the crop; the sort of diagonal line is pleasing to the eye.  Good job.</td>', 'I like this portrait - the black and white works well here, and the woman''s eyes really seem to twinkle.  Nice sharpness (maybe a tad too much, but it works for b&w), and I like the crop; the sort of diagonal line is pleasing to the eye.  Good job.', '2005-04-24 04:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316976, 167831, 31443, '<td valign="top">This photo got my attention and made me think...nice shot and meaningful to boost.. 8</td>', 'This photo got my attention and made me think...nice shot and meaningful to boost.. 8', '2005-04-24 04:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316977, 167336, 16790, '<td valign="top">This photo, I think, would be so much lovelier if the background and other ladies were not blurred out.  I like the choice of sepia tint, and I the shady/sunny spots really give this a nice, warm, fuzzy feel.</td>', 'This photo, I think, would be so much lovelier if the background and other ladies were not blurred out.  I like the choice of sepia tint, and I the shady/sunny spots really give this a nice, warm, fuzzy feel.', '2005-04-24 04:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
