(1316984, 167710, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait - excellent use of colours and background elements here.  Focus, colours, lighting - all wonderful.  I love the composition... marvelous work.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait - excellent use of colours and background elements here.  Focus, colours, lighting - all wonderful.  I love the composition... marvelous work.', '2005-04-24 04:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316985, 167746, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and meaningful......</td>', 'Nice shot and meaningful......', '2005-04-24 04:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316986, 167809, 16790, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww!  This is too precious!  I would have LOVED to see this in colour, and maybe with just a tad more brightness, but the close crop is great for this shot, and the focus is excellent.  Nice!</td>', 'Awwwwww!  This is too precious!  I would have LOVED to see this in colour, and maybe with just a tad more brightness, but the close crop is great for this shot, and the focus is excellent.  Nice!', '2005-04-24 04:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316989, 167544, 16790, '<td valign="top">Not too sure how I feel about the selective desat, but the effect is interesting.  It''d have been great if it wasn''t quite so processed, but this is still a great picture.  Interesting take (tying the title in with the effect); it''s fun to see something different.  Focus and such are very good, and the setting is great.</td>', 'Not too sure how I feel about the selective desat, but the effect is interesting.  It''d have been great if it wasn''t quite so processed, but this is still a great picture.  Interesting take (tying the title in with the effect); it''s fun to see something different.  Focus and such are very good, and the setting is great.', '2005-04-24 04:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316991, 165678, 31443, '<td valign="top">So this is what Santa does during the day? Nice character...</td>', 'So this is what Santa does during the day? Nice character...', '2005-04-24 04:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316993, 166556, 31443, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t like this image that much but now it''s growing on me and its cool...8</td>', 'At first I didn''t like this image that much but now it''s growing on me and its cool...8', '2005-04-24 04:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316994, 167585, 16790, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure what to make of this picture.. it seems like something that would be accompanied by a story or article of some sort.  The colour is a bit washed out and there is a lot of overexposure; I think this might really have been more effective in black and white, or with some editing of curves and colour.  The background is a bit distracting, and the person in the foreground is also a distraction as they are not fully visible, but the main subject is nicely in focus.  Interesting candid.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure what to make of this picture.. it seems like something that would be accompanied by a story or article of some sort.  The colour is a bit washed out and there is a lot of overexposure; I think this might really have been more effective in black and white, or with some editing of curves and colour.  The background is a bit distracting, and the person in the foreground is also a distraction as they are not fully visible, but the main subject is nicely in focus.  Interesting candid.', '2005-04-24 04:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1316999, 167722, 31443, '<td valign="top">Determination on this Superman''s face....nice shot (too bad about the chest muscles though, hope he grows into the costume ;)</td>', 'Determination on this Superman''s face....nice shot (too bad about the chest muscles though, hope he grows into the costume ;)', '2005-04-24 04:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317001, 167594, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I''m assuming the soft focus was on purpose.. it works well in this instance.  A tad more contrast would really make this stand out, but this is, regardless, a unique shot that has been nicely executed.  I like the angle - it really makes a person notice those lovely eyes.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I''m assuming the soft focus was on purpose.. it works well in this instance.  A tad more contrast would really make this stand out, but this is, regardless, a unique shot that has been nicely executed.  I like the angle - it really makes a person notice those lovely eyes.', '2005-04-24 04:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317002, 166933, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice moment...</td>', 'Nice moment...', '2005-04-24 04:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317003, 167765, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  The close crop works marvelously - you''ve really captured something special here.  Focus is perfect, and the contrast seems just right for the moment.  Lovely work.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  The close crop works marvelously - you''ve really captured something special here.  Focus is perfect, and the contrast seems just right for the moment.  Lovely work.', '2005-04-24 04:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317004, 166474, 31443, '<td valign="top">Happy face! Arghh why oh why do children have to suffer?</td>', 'Happy face! Arghh why oh why do children have to suffer?', '2005-04-24 04:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317006, 167238, 31443, '<td valign="top">Proud young man showing off his livestock...nice shot...</td>', 'Proud young man showing off his livestock...nice shot...', '2005-04-24 04:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317007, 165669, 16790, '<td valign="top">The first thing I see when I look at this shot is the marvelous array of textures - I love it.  The composition is awesome, with the man''s eyes very near the centre of the image, and the sharpness is just right.  The colours are lovely; the background gives this sort of a dreamy feel, while the sharpness of the eyes and all the textures bring me back to reality.  Gorgeous work.</td>', 'The first thing I see when I look at this shot is the marvelous array of textures - I love it.  The composition is awesome, with the man''s eyes very near the centre of the image, and the sharpness is just right.  The colours are lovely; the background gives this sort of a dreamy feel, while the sharpness of the eyes and all the textures bring me back to reality.  Gorgeous work.', '2005-04-24 04:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317009, 167353, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  I adore your choice of tones for this, and the focus is absolutely perfect.  Sharpness, contrast, etc. are all great; the composition is excellent as well - the subject is well placed.  The lighting is just right.  Excellent!</td>', 'Lovely!  I adore your choice of tones for this, and the focus is absolutely perfect.  Sharpness, contrast, etc. are all great; the composition is excellent as well - the subject is well placed.  The lighting is just right.  Excellent!', '2005-04-24 04:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317010, 167834, 18552, '<td valign="top">I love your big happy family picture. To me this is what "people" is all about - family. Very nicely done, too. 9</td>', 'I love your big happy family picture. To me this is what "people" is all about - family. Very nicely done, too. 9', '2005-04-24 04:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317012, 167547, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a fun picture! These boys look like they are having such fun with this. I can''t imagine how they don''t fall on their heads.</td>', 'What a fun picture! These boys look like they are having such fun with this. I can''t imagine how they don''t fall on their heads.', '2005-04-24 04:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317013, 167829, 16790, '<td valign="top">Awwww... I like the darkness of this sweet shot.  My eye seems to think that camera needs to be pointed just a tad to the right - that the subjects are a little too close to the middle - but that''s nothing too major as far as I''m concerned.  The focus is nice, with pleasant bokeh, and the toning is great for the mood.  Very emotive shot.</td>', 'Awwww... I like the darkness of this sweet shot.  My eye seems to think that camera needs to be pointed just a tad to the right - that the subjects are a little too close to the middle - but that''s nothing too major as far as I''m concerned.  The focus is nice, with pleasant bokeh, and the toning is great for the mood.  Very emotive shot.', '2005-04-24 04:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317014, 165255, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lighting and sharpness are great - I really like the composition, too.  The way both sides blend easily to black really seems to work well here; lovely work - this is a stunning portrait.</td>', 'Lighting and sharpness are great - I really like the composition, too.  The way both sides blend easily to black really seems to work well here; lovely work - this is a stunning portrait.', '2005-04-24 04:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317015, 167106, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a sweet picture. It is so cute to see the looks little girls get on their faces with lipstick - you can just tell they watch Mom or big sister putting on lipstick and imitate that look.</td>', 'What a sweet picture. It is so cute to see the looks little girls get on their faces with lipstick - you can just tell they watch Mom or big sister putting on lipstick and imitate that look.', '2005-04-24 04:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317016, 166933, 16790, '<td valign="top">I wish this were just a tad more in focus, because this is a very cute shot.  I''m not sure how I feel about the girl''s arm covering half of her face, regardless of the title, though - she looks like an adorable girl, and I''d like to see her full face.  Maybe if this were''t quite so close of a crop it would be more evident what''s going on in this photo.  Regardless, the colours are good and the subject is interesting :)</td>', 'I wish this were just a tad more in focus, because this is a very cute shot.  I''m not sure how I feel about the girl''s arm covering half of her face, regardless of the title, though - she looks like an adorable girl, and I''d like to see her full face.  Maybe if this were''t quite so close of a crop it would be more evident what''s going on in this photo.  Regardless, the colours are good and the subject is interesting :)', '2005-04-24 04:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317017, 167783, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a nice picture. I''d love to know the story behind the look the girl is giving this boy who looks so good natured!</td>', 'What a nice picture. I''d love to know the story behind the look the girl is giving this boy who looks so good natured!', '2005-04-24 04:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317018, 165255, 31772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting... makes the shot... well done.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting... makes the shot... well done.', '2005-04-24 04:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317019, 166784, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photograph - the sharpness, textures, and tones are all absolutely amazing.  Lighting is perfect, and the composition is beautiful - this is one of the most emotive shots in the challenge.  Awesome work.</td>', 'This is an excellent photograph - the sharpness, textures, and tones are all absolutely amazing.  Lighting is perfect, and the composition is beautiful - this is one of the most emotive shots in the challenge.  Awesome work.', '2005-04-24 04:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317020, 167139, 31772, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite work... the guitar player on the left is a bit distracting... perhaps a crop would have been a good idea here.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite work... the guitar player on the left is a bit distracting... perhaps a crop would have been a good idea here.', '2005-04-24 04:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317021, 167372, 31772, '<td valign="top">A nice candid, good composition,  but not the greatest expression.</td>', 'A nice candid, good composition,  but not the greatest expression.', '2005-04-24 04:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
