(1317025, 167746, 16790, '<td valign="top">The clarity of this is excellent, and the man''s position seems very natural; I''d love if this weren''t cropped quite so closely, but it is nonetheless a great shot of a man who looks like he''d have some stories to tell.  Excellent textures here without any oversharpening - nice work.  Colours are great - something I''m really appreciating in this challenge.</td>', 'The clarity of this is excellent, and the man''s position seems very natural; I''d love if this weren''t cropped quite so closely, but it is nonetheless a great shot of a man who looks like he''d have some stories to tell.  Excellent textures here without any oversharpening - nice work.  Colours are great - something I''m really appreciating in this challenge.', '2005-04-24 04:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317026, 167324, 31772, '<td valign="top">That bright sun in the top left is a bit distracting from the person.. if croppped out this would be a very very good shot. .. I''ll still give you an 8 though,  cause I''m a nice person :)</td>', 'That bright sun in the top left is a bit distracting from the person.. if croppped out this would be a very very good shot. .. I''ll still give you an 8 though,  cause I''m a nice person :)', '2005-04-24 04:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317027, 167804, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait - very clear, nicely tones, and of a lovely woman.  My only complaints are a couple of elements that distract me - the buckle on her clothing and the dark spot to the left of the image.  Otherwise - great work!</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait - very clear, nicely tones, and of a lovely woman.  My only complaints are a couple of elements that distract me - the buckle on her clothing and the dark spot to the left of the image.  Otherwise - great work!', '2005-04-24 04:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317028, 167821, 31772, '<td valign="top">A great candid expression... well done</td>', 'A great candid expression... well done', '2005-04-24 04:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
