(1317030, 167596, 16790, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea - I actually like the selective desaturation in this case.  Clarity is good, if slightly oversharpened; the only gripe I really have is the shadow on the right side of the image, which could be taken care of with a bit of dodging.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Interesting idea - I actually like the selective desaturation in this case.  Clarity is good, if slightly oversharpened; the only gripe I really have is the shadow on the right side of the image, which could be taken care of with a bit of dodging.  Nice shot!', '2005-04-24 04:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317031, 167071, 31772, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m speechless... this an incredible candid, one of the best I''ve ever seen... I hope you ribbon for this... 10, I''d give it a 11 if I could.</td>', 'Wow, I''m speechless... this an incredible candid, one of the best I''ve ever seen... I hope you ribbon for this... 10, I''d give it a 11 if I could.', '2005-04-24 04:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
