(1317183, 166341, 36299, '<td valign="top">To dark on the right side of the face.  For me, it would be nice if it was more evenly split, possible in black and white.</td>', 'To dark on the right side of the face.  For me, it would be nice if it was more evenly split, possible in black and white.', '2005-04-24 05:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
