(1317947, 165678, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love the colours, focus, just about everything. The only thing I am debating with myself is if for this particular challenge, if I would have done a tighter crop to bring even more focus to the man. Id be curious to know if you though about cropping at all, or even tried a few different ones.</td>', 'Great capture. I love the colours, focus, just about everything. The only thing I am debating with myself is if for this particular challenge, if I would have done a tighter crop to bring even more focus to the man. Id be curious to know if you though about cropping at all, or even tried a few different ones.', '2005-04-24 11:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1317949, 167744, 25742, '<td valign="top">there is something about the eyes which bothers me. I don''t know how to explain this, but the eyes simply look wrong. nice comp</td>', 'there is something about the eyes which bothers me. I don''t know how to explain this, but the eyes simply look wrong. nice comp', '2005-04-24 11:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
