(1318036, 166311, 10047, '<td valign="top">Wish I could see the eyes. I think they add a lot to portraits. Good expression and sharpness.</td>', 'Wish I could see the eyes. I think they add a lot to portraits. Good expression and sharpness.', '2005-04-24 11:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
