(1318044, 167287, 10047, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF, but not the skin tones. I suspect the tones are suppose to be that way to invoke an old time feeling, but I think the costumes imply that well.</td>', 'I like the DOF, but not the skin tones. I suspect the tones are suppose to be that way to invoke an old time feeling, but I think the costumes imply that well.', '2005-04-24 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
