(1318063, 167213, 30625, '<td valign="top">Good timing both on your part and that of the runners I like how both are in sync I can almost get the feeling of running with them.</td>', 'Good timing both on your part and that of the runners I like how both are in sync I can almost get the feeling of running with them.', '2005-04-24 11:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1318064, 167177, 10047, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like the Soccer Moms didn''t want their faces in the photo. Too bad you couldn''t get the girls running through the other way and then get everyones face with the help of the sun.</td>', 'Almost looks like the Soccer Moms didn''t want their faces in the photo. Too bad you couldn''t get the girls running through the other way and then get everyones face with the help of the sun.', '2005-04-24 11:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1318067, 167616, 25742, '<td valign="top">good capture, good title and a really good idea. The setup is perfect and the title draws your attention to the concept of the photo. good luck /9</td>', 'good capture, good title and a really good idea. The setup is perfect and the title draws your attention to the concept of the photo. good luck /9', '2005-04-24 11:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
