(1319615, 167447, 31213, '<td valign="top">Even thought this shot seems a bit overexposed, I think it works.  The girl is beautiful and almost puts me into a trance when I look at her.  Compoisiton is excellent and sharpness and clarity seems pretty good.  Her eyes are absolutely captivating.  One of my few 10''s for the challenge.<br/> <br/>Chris A</td>', 'Even thought this shot seems a bit overexposed, I think it works.  The girl is beautiful and almost puts me into a trance when I look at her.  Compoisiton is excellent and sharpness and clarity seems pretty good.  Her eyes are absolutely captivating.  One of my few 10''s for the challenge. Chris A', '2005-04-24 17:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319622, 167821, 31213, '<td valign="top">GREAT photograph.  It it was up to me you would ahve a ribbon.  I have to admit, at times I get tired of people submitting pictures of babies.  But this is so refreshingly different.  The lighting is perfect, and the image is tack sharp.  The expression on the baby is priceless!  <br/> <br/>I also like seeing the key light reflection in the babies eyes. I hope you do well.  Adding this to my favorites.  One of my few 10''s of the challenge.</td>', 'GREAT photograph.  It it was up to me you would ahve a ribbon.  I have to admit, at times I get tired of people submitting pictures of babies.  But this is so refreshingly different.  The lighting is perfect, and the image is tack sharp.  The expression on the baby is priceless!   I also like seeing the key light reflection in the babies eyes. I hope you do well.  Adding this to my favorites.  One of my few 10''s of the challenge.', '2005-04-24 17:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319623, 167234, 31213, '<td valign="top">Looks like this could be a poster hanging up on a wall in someones room.  Fantastic work.</td>', 'Looks like this could be a poster hanging up on a wall in someones room.  Fantastic work.', '2005-04-24 17:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319627, 165672, 31213, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The expressions and candidness is perfect.  Composition couldn''t be better.  Very emotional pic.  I look at it, and it makes me feel good every time.  Adding this to my favorites.  One of my few 10''s in the challenge.  Goodluck and Happy Shooting,<br/> <br/> <br/>Chris A</td>', 'Great shot.  The expressions and candidness is perfect.  Composition couldn''t be better.  Very emotional pic.  I look at it, and it makes me feel good every time.  Adding this to my favorites.  One of my few 10''s in the challenge.  Goodluck and Happy Shooting,  Chris A', '2005-04-24 17:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319633, 167804, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very professional.  If you dont have a studio, you could have fooled me!  Very well done.  It looks like a real headshot for a model or actress.  Keep up the good work.  This is one of my few 10''s in this challenge.  <br/> <br/>Happy Shooting,<br/>Chris A</td>', 'Very professional.  If you dont have a studio, you could have fooled me!  Very well done.  It looks like a real headshot for a model or actress.  Keep up the good work.  This is one of my few 10''s in this challenge.   Happy Shooting,Chris A', '2005-04-24 17:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319636, 167425, 31213, '<td valign="top">I''m glad his head is still in relatively good focus even though he is in motion.  I like the spectators in the background.  I think the selective desat works here.  Sometimes I''m not a fan, but this helped separate your subject from the background.  Smart choice.  This is one of my few 10''s of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Happy shooting,<br/> <br/>Chris A</td>', 'I''m glad his head is still in relatively good focus even though he is in motion.  I like the spectators in the background.  I think the selective desat works here.  Sometimes I''m not a fan, but this helped separate your subject from the background.  Smart choice.  This is one of my few 10''s of the challenge. Happy shooting, Chris A', '2005-04-24 17:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
