(1319734, 167654, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 10 the requirments have been met<br/>Composition: 5 a better angle would brought the people out from behind the tree<br/>Technical: 5 The shot seems out of focus or maybe due to the fact that the focus is one the tree rather than the people.<br/>Creativity: 5 Just no wow or photo doesnt pop<br/>Overall: 6</td>', 'Challenge: 10 the requirments have been metComposition: 5 a better angle would brought the people out from behind the treeTechnical: 5 The shot seems out of focus or maybe due to the fact that the focus is one the tree rather than the people.Creativity: 5 Just no wow or photo doesnt popOverall: 6', '2005-04-24 18:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319739, 167215, 16790, '<td valign="top">Awwwww!  I wish this were just a tad more in focus and the highlights weren''t quite so blown out, but this is nonetheless an adorable photo.  It looks like there might have been some burning to blacken the background, as I can still see some random brush strokes of a lighter grey around their heads, so that''s something to perhaps fix at a later date.  The composition is excellent, either way, and this is a wonderful candid capture!  Nice work - you framed this really well.</td>', 'Awwwww!  I wish this were just a tad more in focus and the highlights weren''t quite so blown out, but this is nonetheless an adorable photo.  It looks like there might have been some burning to blacken the background, as I can still see some random brush strokes of a lighter grey around their heads, so that''s something to perhaps fix at a later date.  The composition is excellent, either way, and this is a wonderful candid capture!  Nice work - you framed this really well.', '2005-04-24 18:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319740, 167596, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of selective desat.  I''m not sure I would''ve taken that route.  Hard to tell without seeing it in all color.  I wish I could say what it is, but something feels off balance with this image.  Maybe if the background was dark grey or solid white?  Cool shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Very interesting use of selective desat.  I''m not sure I would''ve taken that route.  Hard to tell without seeing it in all color.  I wish I could say what it is, but something feels off balance with this image.  Maybe if the background was dark grey or solid white?  Cool shot nonetheless.', '2005-04-24 18:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319742, 167178, 16790, '<td valign="top">Wow - awesome shot.  The colours here are so vivid, and the composition works very well.  You''ve done a fantastic job freezing action here, and I absolutely adore those colours.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Wow - awesome shot.  The colours here are so vivid, and the composition works very well.  You''ve done a fantastic job freezing action here, and I absolutely adore those colours.  Excellent work.', '2005-04-24 18:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319746, 166355, 30049, '<td valign="top">Busy place.  Lots to look at.  Maybe too much?  This image is ok - it could be a bit sharper and have some sort of focal point.</td>', 'Busy place.  Lots to look at.  Maybe too much?  This image is ok - it could be a bit sharper and have some sort of focal point.', '2005-04-24 18:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319748, 167176, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 10 meets my requirments or person or people<br/>Compostion: 10 I love the way you filled the frame. The left side orientation adds to the right side with the use of the trumpet<br/>Technical: 10 Very sharp and the colors are just delightful. I can see the various tonal shadows of the brass. A color very hard to show in digital photographs.<br/>Creativity: 10<br/>Overall: 10</td>', 'Challenge: 10 meets my requirments or person or peopleCompostion: 10 I love the way you filled the frame. The left side orientation adds to the right side with the use of the trumpetTechnical: 10 Very sharp and the colors are just delightful. I can see the various tonal shadows of the brass. A color very hard to show in digital photographs.Creativity: 10Overall: 10', '2005-04-24 18:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319750, 167556, 23251, '<td valign="top">Good lighting</td>', 'Good lighting', '2005-04-24 18:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319752, 167757, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo - this would''ve been great for the Off-Screen Expectation (or whatever that challenge was called) awhile back.  I really like the composition; the photo feels nicely balanced, and the colours seem to be right on.  Clarity is excellent, and the title ties in nicely with the angle used.  Focus is great here, too - nice work.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo - this would''ve been great for the Off-Screen Expectation (or whatever that challenge was called) awhile back.  I really like the composition; the photo feels nicely balanced, and the colours seem to be right on.  Clarity is excellent, and the title ties in nicely with the angle used.  Focus is great here, too - nice work.', '2005-04-24 18:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319753, 167751, 23251, '<td valign="top">Just a little dark around the eyes</td>', 'Just a little dark around the eyes', '2005-04-24 18:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319755, 167585, 23251, '<td valign="top">A very busy shot</td>', 'A very busy shot', '2005-04-24 18:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319758, 167750, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow - She jumps right out at you.  Nice shot!  The bright yellow gives the image a boost (might be a tad too much reflecting on the girl?  Personal opinion I guess).  The composition is nice.  The way her arm trails off at an angle to the corner ties that part of the image in well.  Good job.</td>', 'Wow - She jumps right out at you.  Nice shot!  The bright yellow gives the image a boost (might be a tad too much reflecting on the girl?  Personal opinion I guess).  The composition is nice.  The way her arm trails off at an angle to the corner ties that part of the image in well.  Good job.', '2005-04-24 18:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319759, 167578, 23251, '<td valign="top">Very moody shot but the eye to the left is lost in the darkness on my screen.</td>', 'Very moody shot but the eye to the left is lost in the darkness on my screen.', '2005-04-24 18:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319760, 167781, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is just precious!  You''ve done the black and white perfectly here - the way the foreground, subject, and background contrast is excellent; the child really stands out against the grass(?).  Texture on the wood is fantastic, and the framing for this works, though I would like to see just a little more space above the child''s head.  Regardless, this is a great shot!</td>', 'This is just precious!  You''ve done the black and white perfectly here - the way the foreground, subject, and background contrast is excellent; the child really stands out against the grass(?).  Texture on the wood is fantastic, and the framing for this works, though I would like to see just a little more space above the child''s head.  Regardless, this is a great shot!', '2005-04-24 18:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319764, 165678, 23251, '<td valign="top">The photo seems tilted forward.</td>', 'The photo seems tilted forward.', '2005-04-24 18:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
