(1319773, 167750, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 10 This is what you call a portrait with natural setting. Better than a studio<br/>Composition: 10 I love how you used the flowers to contrast her. of centered to the right gives the rule of thirds a 10<br/>Technical: 10 The image is very sharp and I think not going for a soft focus really makes this shot good as you are trying to show the flowers along with her.<br/>Creativity: 10 I like the set up of using the flowers against her natural tonal skin<br/>Overall: 10 Well done<br/> <br/>I hope this ribbons. Good Luch oh and she is beautiful.</td>', 'Challenge: 10 This is what you call a portrait with natural setting. Better than a studioComposition: 10 I love how you used the flowers to contrast her. of centered to the right gives the rule of thirds a 10Technical: 10 The image is very sharp and I think not going for a soft focus really makes this shot good as you are trying to show the flowers along with her.Creativity: 10 I like the set up of using the flowers against her natural tonal skinOverall: 10 Well done I hope this ribbons. Good Luch oh and she is beautiful.', '2005-04-24 18:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319778, 167106, 16790, '<td valign="top">Awww... such an adorable little girl.  I love the softness of this, and the brightness; I like that pink and white make up the majority of the photo, aside from the subjects'' faces.  There are only two distractions that I see - the blue bit in the upper right, and the slight movement of the lipstick-holding hand.  I would love to see this with that blue part desaturated and lightened a bit.  Regardless though, this is a very cute capture that is well framed - I like the closeness in this case.  Lovely photograph.</td>', 'Awww... such an adorable little girl.  I love the softness of this, and the brightness; I like that pink and white make up the majority of the photo, aside from the subjects'' faces.  There are only two distractions that I see - the blue bit in the upper right, and the slight movement of the lipstick-holding hand.  I would love to see this with that blue part desaturated and lightened a bit.  Regardless though, this is a very cute capture that is well framed - I like the closeness in this case.  Lovely photograph.', '2005-04-24 18:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319780, 166030, 23251, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture but the over use of unsharpen mask has spoilt this a little for me.</td>', 'Lovely capture but the over use of unsharpen mask has spoilt this a little for me.', '2005-04-24 18:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319786, 167255, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great capture, just a little tilted.</td>', 'Great capture, just a little tilted.', '2005-04-24 18:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319789, 165750, 16790, '<td valign="top">Marvelous textures and clarity; I like your choice of a close crop, and the background is neutral enough to work.  The tonal range here is wonderful, with neither blown hightlights or overly deep shadows; lovely job - the focus is excellent too.  I like the faint toning as well.  Excellent job.</td>', 'Marvelous textures and clarity; I like your choice of a close crop, and the background is neutral enough to work.  The tonal range here is wonderful, with neither blown hightlights or overly deep shadows; lovely job - the focus is excellent too.  I like the faint toning as well.  Excellent job.', '2005-04-24 18:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319791, 167791, 23251, '<td valign="top">Looks like they are having fun.  Well done.</td>', 'Looks like they are having fun.  Well done.', '2005-04-24 18:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319794, 167807, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great DOF</td>', 'Great DOF', '2005-04-24 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319795, 167823, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is different.  Nice work with the colours - they all tie together to make for a photo that''s fun to look at.  Clarity is excellent, and the focus is right on.  Interesting composition; it feels very balanced, and I like the overall effect.</td>', 'This is different.  Nice work with the colours - they all tie together to make for a photo that''s fun to look at.  Clarity is excellent, and the focus is right on.  Interesting composition; it feels very balanced, and I like the overall effect.', '2005-04-24 18:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319798, 165523, 23251, '<td valign="top">Pity he is cut off on the right.</td>', 'Pity he is cut off on the right.', '2005-04-24 18:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319802, 167616, 23251, '<td valign="top">Whats he on ;)</td>', 'Whats he on ;)', '2005-04-24 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319803, 167279, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous - wow.  The softness is exquisite, while the clarity of the child is flawless; no oversharpening or overprocessing here.  The tones are absolutely gorgeous, and the composition is excellent.  This is beautiful work.</td>', 'This is gorgeous - wow.  The softness is exquisite, while the clarity of the child is flawless; no oversharpening or overprocessing here.  The tones are absolutely gorgeous, and the composition is excellent.  This is beautiful work.', '2005-04-24 18:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319804, 166212, 20330, '<td valign="top">very soft but with great detail. I love the eyes and the light in them. nice work. 9</td>', 'very soft but with great detail. I love the eyes and the light in them. nice work. 9', '2005-04-24 18:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319806, 167414, 23251, '<td valign="top">The man behind his head is a little distracting.</td>', 'The man behind his head is a little distracting.', '2005-04-24 18:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319807, 167290, 20330, '<td valign="top">I love these older burly looking man photos, however the lighting/shadow on this is mildly distracting.... 7</td>', 'I love these older burly looking man photos, however the lighting/shadow on this is mildly distracting.... 7', '2005-04-24 18:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319811, 167783, 23251, '<td valign="top">Oh ohhhh... Great capture.</td>', 'Oh ohhhh... Great capture.', '2005-04-24 18:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319812, 166924, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great shot.  This one''s a keeper - get it up on the wall.  Nice tones and contrast (maybe a bit dark, but not much).  Good job.</td>', 'Wow!  Great shot.  This one''s a keeper - get it up on the wall.  Nice tones and contrast (maybe a bit dark, but not much).  Good job.', '2005-04-24 18:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319814, 165255, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2005-04-24 18:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319815, 167660, 20330, '<td valign="top">this is good. however my critique would be a tighter crop, just the face and maybe a little shoulder. The sheets distract from the beauty of the girl. 7</td>', 'this is good. however my critique would be a tighter crop, just the face and maybe a little shoulder. The sheets distract from the beauty of the girl. 7', '2005-04-24 18:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319817, 167178, 23251, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly tilted</td>', 'Looks slightly tilted', '2005-04-24 18:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319820, 167834, 23251, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly tilted.</td>', 'Looks slightly tilted.', '2005-04-24 18:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319822, 167447, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a very fun, colourful photo!  I would have liked to see a slightly deeper DOF - the out of focus jewelry that is a bit further back makes the whole thing feel slightly blurry, even though it''s not.  I think it''s that they''re not soft enough to be totally out of focus, and therefore draw the eye.  Speaking of eyes, it would be great if hers stood out a little more, too - maybe burning the darker parts a tad and dodging the highlights - that would give her a bit more mystique.  Regardless, I really like this picture - it''s unique and colourful, and the general composition is pleasing to the eye.  The smoky looking backround compliments the subject, too.  Nice job - some minor editing on the eyes would really make this fantastic.</td>', 'This is a very fun, colourful photo!  I would have liked to see a slightly deeper DOF - the out of focus jewelry that is a bit further back makes the whole thing feel slightly blurry, even though it''s not.  I think it''s that they''re not soft enough to be totally out of focus, and therefore draw the eye.  Speaking of eyes, it would be great if hers stood out a little more, too - maybe burning the darker parts a tad and dodging the highlights - that would give her a bit more mystique.  Regardless, I really like this picture - it''s unique and colourful, and the general composition is pleasing to the eye.  The smoky looking backround compliments the subject, too.  Nice job - some minor editing on the eyes would really make this fantastic.', '2005-04-24 18:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319823, 167259, 20330, '<td valign="top">personally, I think this is way too high key. the detail is totally blown out and then the added eye color looks very painted. 6</td>', 'personally, I think this is way too high key. the detail is totally blown out and then the added eye color looks very painted. 6', '2005-04-24 18:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319827, 167154, 23251, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2005-04-24 18:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319829, 166354, 20330, '<td valign="top">nice self portrait, you have nice eyes. love the detail and the b/w 8</td>', 'nice self portrait, you have nice eyes. love the detail and the b/w 8', '2005-04-24 18:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319832, 166212, 30049, '<td valign="top">Definitely fills the frame.  With a shot this close attention to all details will make or break it...with that said, I''m wondering what the reflection is in her eyes?  Other than that I think it''s a great photo.  Good work.</td>', 'Definitely fills the frame.  With a shot this close attention to all details will make or break it...with that said, I''m wondering what the reflection is in her eyes?  Other than that I think it''s a great photo.  Good work.', '2005-04-24 18:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319834, 167530, 23251, '<td valign="top">It seems a little to dark but that could be my new monitor.</td>', 'It seems a little to dark but that could be my new monitor.', '2005-04-24 18:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319835, 167834, 20330, '<td valign="top">wow, nice large family shot! hard to fit all those people in one shot.</td>', 'wow, nice large family shot! hard to fit all those people in one shot.', '2005-04-24 18:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319840, 166572, 23251, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but the background distracts a little.</td>', 'Interesting shot but the background distracts a little.', '2005-04-24 18:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319842, 167291, 30625, '<td valign="top">Well executed. You captured just at the right moment.</td>', 'Well executed. You captured just at the right moment.', '2005-04-24 18:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319843, 167291, 16790, '<td valign="top">I like the overall effect here, but the subject doesn''t look very serene - she looks either deep in thought, uncomfortable, or a tad grouchy.  The setting, though, is just beautiful, and the girl is lovely.  Lighting is nice, and the contrast seems to be right where it belongs; overall, the scene has a feeling of serenity even if that''s not what I''m getting from the subject''s expression.</td>', 'I like the overall effect here, but the subject doesn''t look very serene - she looks either deep in thought, uncomfortable, or a tad grouchy.  The setting, though, is just beautiful, and the girl is lovely.  Lighting is nice, and the contrast seems to be right where it belongs; overall, the scene has a feeling of serenity even if that''s not what I''m getting from the subject''s expression.', '2005-04-24 18:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319845, 166354, 30049, '<td valign="top">Must be a stay at home type?  Nobody else to get a picture of?  ;^)  It''s a nice photo, clean and crisp.  Good tonal range in the B/W.</td>', 'Must be a stay at home type?  Nobody else to get a picture of?  ;^)  It''s a nice photo, clean and crisp.  Good tonal range in the B/W.', '2005-04-24 18:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319847, 167417, 23251, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft focus, its a pity you did not keep the eyes crisp.</td>', 'Lovely soft focus, its a pity you did not keep the eyes crisp.', '2005-04-24 18:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319852, 167781, 20330, '<td valign="top">i want to say my critique would be a different angle, larger crop, maybe being closer to the ground and the girl farther away.. but then again I don''t like to see these sort of subjects so large in an image, its almost crossing the line.... 6</td>', 'i want to say my critique would be a different angle, larger crop, maybe being closer to the ground and the girl farther away.. but then again I don''t like to see these sort of subjects so large in an image, its almost crossing the line.... 6', '2005-04-24 18:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319854, 167532, 23251, '<td valign="top">Walking out of the frame, make me want to see where she is going.</td>', 'Walking out of the frame, make me want to see where she is going.', '2005-04-24 18:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319861, 165601, 20330, '<td valign="top">nice to see a portrait not of one of the lovely people. love it. 10</td>', 'nice to see a portrait not of one of the lovely people. love it. 10', '2005-04-24 18:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1319863, 167768, 23251, '<td valign="top">The people don''t seem to be the main focus of the shot.  Is this you Dirk?</td>', 'The people don''t seem to be the main focus of the shot.  Is this you Dirk?', '2005-04-24 18:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
