(1319901, 167607, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great shot, pity the baby was not looking at the camera. A touch of neat image would also have helped I think.</td>', 'Great shot, pity the baby was not looking at the camera. A touch of neat image would also have helped I think.', '2005-04-24 18:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
