(1319913, 167194, 23278, '<td valign="top">Looks like too much burning in the sky. Would have like to see a tighter crop on the women. But it is a very nice scene.</td>', 'Looks like too much burning in the sky. Would have like to see a tighter crop on the women. But it is a very nice scene.', '2005-04-24 18:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
