(1320271, 167194, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok...big sky, that''s cool (and also very hip right now).  ;^)  The B/W works, but I think it''s a tad too dark.  If you were going for the dark sky maybe a different application of curves would have worked the sky without the foreground so much?  Just a thought.  Nice pic.</td>', 'Ok...big sky, that''s cool (and also very hip right now).  ;^)  The B/W works, but I think it''s a tad too dark.  If you were going for the dark sky maybe a different application of curves would have worked the sky without the foreground so much?  Just a thought.  Nice pic.', '2005-04-24 20:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320273, 167125, 18505, '<td valign="top">I like the way the stairs provide a frame for the portrait.</td>', 'I like the way the stairs provide a frame for the portrait.', '2005-04-24 20:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320274, 167366, 22734, '<td valign="top">Expertly captured to project the intensity of the character. 7</td>', 'Expertly captured to project the intensity of the character. 7', '2005-04-24 20:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320275, 167754, 30049, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail I thought it was B/W...is it duotone?  Nice lighting, interesting effect.  Might be a bit hot on the side of the face and top left shoulder.  JMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'From the thumbnail I thought it was B/W...is it duotone?  Nice lighting, interesting effect.  Might be a bit hot on the side of the face and top left shoulder.  JMO.  Good luck.', '2005-04-24 20:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
