(1320281, 167363, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the people (composition).  The line of lights adds another dimension that is interesting.  Nice B/W tonal range.</td>', 'Nice placement of the people (composition).  The line of lights adds another dimension that is interesting.  Nice B/W tonal range.', '2005-04-24 20:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
