(1320288, 166438, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ordinary and looking right at you!  ;^)  Very clean...did you use Neat Image, or is your camera just that good!  Pretty good range on exposure and B/W''s.  Maybe a bit hot on the ladies cheek in the center.  Overall, very nice.</td>', 'Ordinary and looking right at you!  ;^)  Very clean...did you use Neat Image, or is your camera just that good!  Pretty good range on exposure and B/W''s.  Maybe a bit hot on the ladies cheek in the center.  Overall, very nice.', '2005-04-24 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320293, 167604, 18505, '<td valign="top">Great textures and tones.  Bumping this to a 10.  I''ve looked at it four times now and like it better each time I see it.  Great work!!</td>', 'Great textures and tones.  Bumping this to a 10.  I''ve looked at it four times now and like it better each time I see it.  Great work!!', '2005-04-24 20:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
