(1320307, 167704, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why such a large border?  The mans face is well focused and interesting.  Trying to figure out the emotion...  Except for the border, I like it.  Good job.</td>', 'Why such a large border?  The mans face is well focused and interesting.  Trying to figure out the emotion...  Except for the border, I like it.  Good job.', '2005-04-24 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
