(1320314, 167213, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words with your title.  Fun image to look at.  The lighting is a bit challenging, looks like midday, but you handled it fine.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice play on words with your title.  Fun image to look at.  The lighting is a bit challenging, looks like midday, but you handled it fine.  Good job.', '2005-04-24 20:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
