(1320333, 167615, 28141, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but it needs better focus and the blowout in the upper right is distracting.</td>', 'Good composition, but it needs better focus and the blowout in the upper right is distracting.', '2005-04-24 20:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
