(1320844, 167616, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and composed.<br/>I love the title you chose for this and how foreground and background are all in focus, which works well here.</td>', 'Well seen and composed.I love the title you chose for this and how foreground and background are all in focus, which works well here.', '2005-04-24 22:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320850, 167758, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot with exceptional detail level.<br/>Only item I have a bit of an issue is how busy it really is and how the people are not the main focal point of the shot. Perhaps a tighter crop so the background isn''t so obvious.</td>', 'Nice clear shot with exceptional detail level.Only item I have a bit of an issue is how busy it really is and how the people are not the main focal point of the shot. Perhaps a tighter crop so the background isn''t so obvious.', '2005-04-24 22:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
