(1320965, 167833, 19978, '<td valign="top">She sure is. The softness and tones are outstanding, but I think the shadows on the face are a bit too much. I''m not sure what kind of lighting you were using but there''s obviously a powerful overhead providing the majority of the illumination. I envision more of a backlit bright, with soft fills coming from the front/side of the little girl to soften the shadows on her face.</td>', 'She sure is. The softness and tones are outstanding, but I think the shadows on the face are a bit too much. I''m not sure what kind of lighting you were using but there''s obviously a powerful overhead providing the majority of the illumination. I envision more of a backlit bright, with soft fills coming from the front/side of the little girl to soften the shadows on her face.', '2005-04-24 23:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1320969, 167833, 25787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl.  Needs more lite on her face.</td>', 'Beautiful girl.  Needs more lite on her face.', '2005-04-24 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
