(1320988, 167437, 27847, '<td valign="top">Now, we have an artist being photographed by a professional photographer, in my opinion anyways! What an excellent photo which conveys great emotion in it and great use of the background (something different instead of the plain color background). Hail to the master! ;-)</td>', 'Now, we have an artist being photographed by a professional photographer, in my opinion anyways! What an excellent photo which conveys great emotion in it and great use of the background (something different instead of the plain color background). Hail to the master! ;-)', '2005-04-24 23:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
