(1321187, 167329, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very photogenic subjects, and the colors are nice. The way the girls are sitting though, the picture almost naturally appears split in two... I wonder if you could have gotten in closer, and just gotten two of them in a more close-up candid. It would allow showing more detail in each of their faces, esp. the eyes.</td>', 'Very photogenic subjects, and the colors are nice. The way the girls are sitting though, the picture almost naturally appears split in two... I wonder if you could have gotten in closer, and just gotten two of them in a more close-up candid. It would allow showing more detail in each of their faces, esp. the eyes.', '2005-04-24 23:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
