(1321194, 167670, 33560, '<td valign="top">Priceless expression.  Nice framing.  Sharp focus &amp; nice DOF.  Being relatively new to photography I am inclined to like photos that are just a little more contrasty. My impression is that the subject''s face is just a little under lit - though I do appreciate the strong highlights and good shadows it shows.</td>', 'Priceless expression.  Nice framing.  Sharp focus & nice DOF.  Being relatively new to photography I am inclined to like photos that are just a little more contrasty. My impression is that the subject''s face is just a little under lit - though I do appreciate the strong highlights and good shadows it shows.', '2005-04-24 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1321196, 167816, 31042, '<td valign="top">This photo looks good from the thumb, but enlarging it in this form reveals that it is of a low resolution and ''pixelated''.  If not for this major downfall, it would be a great shot.</td>', 'This photo looks good from the thumb, but enlarging it in this form reveals that it is of a low resolution and ''pixelated''.  If not for this major downfall, it would be a great shot.', '2005-04-24 23:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1321197, 167447, 31042, '<td valign="top">Very Nice,   I like the fact that there isn''t another one of these in this challenge.  The Eyes really stand you, and why shouldn''t they.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Very Nice,   I like the fact that there isn''t another one of these in this challenge.  The Eyes really stand you, and why shouldn''t they.  Beautiful.', '2005-04-24 23:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
