(1321223, 167143, 28742, '<td valign="top">As tired as I am of seeing this same shot done over and over, this one has some beautiful uniqueness to it. Can''t bring myself to punish you for the unoriginality of the subject - it''s just a great shot. Well done.</td>', 'As tired as I am of seeing this same shot done over and over, this one has some beautiful uniqueness to it. Can''t bring myself to punish you for the unoriginality of the subject - it''s just a great shot. Well done.', '2005-04-25 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
