(1321226, 167804, 33560, '<td valign="top">The lighting is exquisite.  The model is beautiful and has a very warm expression.  Nice tilt of the head and smile.  I''m a bit surprised that you did not use clone tool to take out the cracks in the lower lip.  And being easily distracted, I find the rectangular buckly thing a tiny bit distracting.  Still, this strikes me as being superb portraiture - I am in awe at the way the skin glows.</td>', 'The lighting is exquisite.  The model is beautiful and has a very warm expression.  Nice tilt of the head and smile.  I''m a bit surprised that you did not use clone tool to take out the cracks in the lower lip.  And being easily distracted, I find the rectangular buckly thing a tiny bit distracting.  Still, this strikes me as being superb portraiture - I am in awe at the way the skin glows.', '2005-04-25 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1321228, 167078, 27812, '<td valign="top">great lighting and composition.. either a tighter or looser crop woulkd have worked better I think... PM me if you dont understand.. it is a great pic worth making perfect.</td>', 'great lighting and composition.. either a tighter or looser crop woulkd have worked better I think... PM me if you dont understand.. it is a great pic worth making perfect.', '2005-04-25 00:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
