(1321498, 165470, 26936, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, this is a fantastic setting, it''s in a very small canyon.  It''s loaded with ancient petroglyphs, the photographer with the green cover is using large format film, that''s my gang patiently waiting for him to complete his work.  Somehow we got separated, I decided to take a shot of the "action".  You can spot some writings at the left corner near the water bottle.  I have lots of shots from this outing should anyone be interested in seeing them.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, this is a fantastic setting, it''s in a very small canyon.  It''s loaded with ancient petroglyphs, the photographer with the green cover is using large format film, that''s my gang patiently waiting for him to complete his work.  Somehow we got separated, I decided to take a shot of the "action".  You can spot some writings at the left corner near the water bottle.  I have lots of shots from this outing should anyone be interested in seeing them.', '2005-04-25 01:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
