(1322164, 167143, 22781, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for voting and commenting.<br/>This week has been a rush, with my score going up and down.<br/>I am extremely happy with my first ribbon, and the color isnt that bad either, matches the shawl nicely.<br/> <br/>I want to say something about some of the comments I got:<br/> <br/>First: Docktornick, could you post some pictures of you eating your D1?<br/>Second:  The white in the eyes is not dodged, its really white. I will post some pictures in the forum later to show you.<br/> <br/>Then I have to thank a few people:<br/>Librodo, thank you for motivating, and believing in me.<br/>Thanks for all the help you gave me and your positive and constructive comments from the moment I tried portraits. You know this blue belongs only half to me, the other half is yours!<br/> <br/>Kiwiness for inspiration and Anastasia for your comments.<br/> <br/>Last but not least osari for getting me back in photography 2 years ago.</td>', 'Thank you all for voting and commenting.This week has been a rush, with my score going up and down.I am extremely happy with my first ribbon, and the color isnt that bad either, matches the shawl nicely. I want to say something about some of the comments I got: First: Docktornick, could you post some pictures of you eating your D1?Second:  The white in the eyes is not dodged, its really white. I will post some pictures in the forum later to show you. Then I have to thank a few people:Librodo, thank you for motivating, and believing in me.Thanks for all the help you gave me and your positive and constructive comments from the moment I tried portraits. You know this blue belongs only half to me, the other half is yours! Kiwiness for inspiration and Anastasia for your comments. Last but not least osari for getting me back in photography 2 years ago.', '2005-04-25 02:51:27.000000', NULL, 0),
