(1322466, 166030, 20608, '<td valign="top">OK you all deserve an explanation about what happened to this shot..<br/> <br/>This shot was edited on a laptop due to me being away from home, I thought it was great and looked wonderful on THAT monitor, I was satisfied. After returning home and seeing it on my MAC I was HORRIFIED!! and I tried to repair it by the deadline and missed it due to the time difference.<br/> <br/>Yeh i could of pulled the image out i guess but I didn''t.<br/> <br/>Thank you for all the comments they all helped (apart from 1 or 2 but its all good).<br/> <br/>I think I blew the chance of a ribbon here but learned a valuable lesson.</td>', 'OK you all deserve an explanation about what happened to this shot.. This shot was edited on a laptop due to me being away from home, I thought it was great and looked wonderful on THAT monitor, I was satisfied. After returning home and seeing it on my MAC I was HORRIFIED!! and I tried to repair it by the deadline and missed it due to the time difference. Yeh i could of pulled the image out i guess but I didn''t. Thank you for all the comments they all helped (apart from 1 or 2 but its all good). I think I blew the chance of a ribbon here but learned a valuable lesson.', '2005-04-25 04:01:42.000000', NULL, 0),
