(1322659, 166354, 23458, '<td valign="top">Sheesh - in between the baseball cap and the camera, you look like a celebrity trying to hide their identity :P. <br/> <br/>Funnily enough I find the backwards writing on the cap a little disconcerting - other than that this is definately better than the average photog with a mirror shot, I like the framing effect given by that table or whatever it is on the bottom. <br/> <br/>Now put that fuji someplace it can gather the requisite layer of dust and get on board with team pentax.<br/> <br/>Edit: Would you look at that - you just became the 1000th recipient of one of my comments. Now sure 980 of them were probably of little use to anyone :), but I think it''s an occasion worth marking all the same. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-25 05:05:06.</i></td>', 'Sheesh - in between the baseball cap and the camera, you look like a celebrity trying to hide their identity :P.  Funnily enough I find the backwards writing on the cap a little disconcerting - other than that this is definately better than the average photog with a mirror shot, I like the framing effect given by that table or whatever it is on the bottom.  Now put that fuji someplace it can gather the requisite layer of dust and get on board with team pentax. Edit: Would you look at that - you just became the 1000th recipient of one of my comments. Now sure 980 of them were probably of little use to anyone :), but I think it''s an occasion worth marking all the same. ', '2005-04-25 06:02:52.000000', '2005-04-25 06:05:06.000000', 0),
(1322674, 167143, 27901, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, this picture is great. Lucky you to have such an inspiration around in that little girl;-)</td>', 'Congratulations, this picture is great. Lucky you to have such an inspiration around in that little girl;-)', '2005-04-25 06:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
