(1322719, 167143, 22781, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by librodo:</b></div><hr/><i> You deserve all the accolades!  You were a great learner and you have your distinct style.  Congrats on a well-deserved win!<br/> <br/>Now....where''s the party.  You will be coming over to bangkok, won''t you?<br/> <br/>Manny </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Manny, <br/> <br/>I will be in Thailand in a few (2-4) months, just don''t go to the Philipines like you did last year :)<br/>I realy need the break by the way, it''s a shame that I did not win a roundtrip Bankok with this photo.<br/> <br/>Thanks again mr. Teacher :-b</td>', 'Originally posted by librodo: You deserve all the accolades!  You were a great learner and you have your distinct style.  Congrats on a well-deserved win! Now....where''s the party.  You will be coming over to bangkok, won''t you? Manny   Manny,  I will be in Thailand in a few (2-4) months, just don''t go to the Philipines like you did last year :)I realy need the break by the way, it''s a shame that I did not win a roundtrip Bankok with this photo. Thanks again mr. Teacher :-b', '2005-04-25 07:12:23.000000', NULL, 0),
