(1323276, 167618, 14386, '<td valign="top">One of my two favorites in this challenge.  You''ve made the right pick.  This is YOU.  <br/> <br/>Like the composition a lot and the control of DOF.  Way underrated...<br/> <br/>(I didn''t realize this is what you submitted...I have a close look at this today and there''s a lot to enjoy in this image.  The color tone helps a lot.<br/> <br/>This firmed your position up in the a-class list!<br/> <br/>manny</td>', 'One of my two favorites in this challenge.  You''ve made the right pick.  This is YOU.   Like the composition a lot and the control of DOF.  Way underrated... (I didn''t realize this is what you submitted...I have a close look at this today and there''s a lot to enjoy in this image.  The color tone helps a lot. This firmed your position up in the a-class list! manny', '2005-04-25 10:50:01.000000', NULL, 0),
