(1324322, 167789, 25655, '<td valign="top">Highly underrated IMO!<br/>Great candid. <br/>The kids'' face look a little bit too red, which can be very easily fixed by playing with the levels on the red channel.<br/>Their pose is wonderful and I love the dream-like softness.<br/>Nice job! This one deserves a much better placing on the challenge.</td>', 'Highly underrated IMO!Great candid. The kids'' face look a little bit too red, which can be very easily fixed by playing with the levels on the red channel.Their pose is wonderful and I love the dream-like softness.Nice job! This one deserves a much better placing on the challenge.', '2005-04-25 14:53:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1324429, 165672, 6349, '<td valign="top">Congrats.  Great score.  Love this photo.</td>', 'Congrats.  Great score.  Love this photo.', '2005-04-25 15:11:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1324650, 166638, 36563, '<td valign="top">That''s a crying shame the place you got. This was my favorite photograph in the contest and I strongly believe it should have won! I completely disagree with a previous comment that the bottom should have been cropped. It would have taken away from the distance between viewer and subject, an aspect that was a favorite of mine. I absolutely love the blue light that radiates from the center, not to mention I''m a sucker for scrappy looking places! ;-) Congrats on your top 20, though.. even if you should have gotten better!</td>', 'That''s a crying shame the place you got. This was my favorite photograph in the contest and I strongly believe it should have won! I completely disagree with a previous comment that the bottom should have been cropped. It would have taken away from the distance between viewer and subject, an aspect that was a favorite of mine. I absolutely love the blue light that radiates from the center, not to mention I''m a sucker for scrappy looking places! ;-) Congrats on your top 20, though.. even if you should have gotten better!', '2005-04-25 16:14:23.000000', NULL, 0),
