(1325284, 165601, 20018, '<td valign="top">really one of my favorites of this challenge. Probably because of the clean unadulterated honesty in his face. I love that exchange you sometimes get between the subject and the camera that simply states," I''m here, this is me, no more and no less."  I guess it''s also a look which given without premise and without insecurity.  Great capture.</td>', 'really one of my favorites of this challenge. Probably because of the clean unadulterated honesty in his face. I love that exchange you sometimes get between the subject and the camera that simply states," I''m here, this is me, no more and no less."  I guess it''s also a look which given without premise and without insecurity.  Great capture.', '2005-04-25 18:45:08.000000', NULL, 0),
