(1326334, 167781, 35517, '<td valign="top">love this shot... pure fun of a little girl......just like we used to do in the old days....lol.... pre all the hoo haa about a naked child, to me it''s still the most precious thing of a child ''s youth......we were born naked, then we played naked..... a very comfortable situation... thanks for being brave to put it on, as i have many of these shots too.... makes you wonder why people have a ''thing'' with it ?, she''s not doing anything, you can''t even see her face.....<br/>great work..... need more fun shots like this.....<br/></td>', 'love this shot... pure fun of a little girl......just like we used to do in the old days....lol.... pre all the hoo haa about a naked child, to me it''s still the most precious thing of a child ''s youth......we were born naked, then we played naked..... a very comfortable situation... thanks for being brave to put it on, as i have many of these shots too.... makes you wonder why people have a ''thing'' with it ?, she''s not doing anything, you can''t even see her face.....great work..... need more fun shots like this.....', '2005-04-25 23:16:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1326362, 167256, 12311, '<td valign="top">Marj, a technically superb photograph, but even more, just a wonderful scene.  I love the contrast in expressions between the old man and the little boy.  Congrats on your high placement in this challenge! -len</td>', 'Marj, a technically superb photograph, but even more, just a wonderful scene.  I love the contrast in expressions between the old man and the little boy.  Congrats on your high placement in this challenge! -len', '2005-04-25 23:21:11.000000', NULL, 0),
