(1326802, 167437, 29904, '<td valign="top">The moment this popped up said wow and hit the 10. Each time I look I want higher numbers to give it.  I love the rich colors, contrast, placement, textures (esp the background is outstanding), and the expression shows a depth and hardship of a free spirit.  I am really in awe of people who can do portraits, it is a struggle for me to even point the camera at strangers.  Would you consider writing up a tutorial for us grovellers?  Esp on ways to make people comfortable and be natural?<br/>Thanks so much for your inspiration!</td>', 'The moment this popped up said wow and hit the 10. Each time I look I want higher numbers to give it.  I love the rich colors, contrast, placement, textures (esp the background is outstanding), and the expression shows a depth and hardship of a free spirit.  I am really in awe of people who can do portraits, it is a struggle for me to even point the camera at strangers.  Would you consider writing up a tutorial for us grovellers?  Esp on ways to make people comfortable and be natural?Thanks so much for your inspiration!', '2005-04-26 01:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
