(1329450, 167706, 23458, '<td valign="top">Saw this during the challenge - gave it an eight, it had more emotional impact that just about all the other shots. Thus, I''m a little surprised at the placing, but oh well! My only complaint is the texture in the shadowy part of the wall - it distracts slightly. Otherwise, terrific work - keep it up.</td>', 'Saw this during the challenge - gave it an eight, it had more emotional impact that just about all the other shots. Thus, I''m a little surprised at the placing, but oh well! My only complaint is the texture in the shadowy part of the wall - it distracts slightly. Otherwise, terrific work - keep it up.', '2005-04-26 19:32:05.000000', NULL, 0),
