(1340266, 167632, 28359, '<td valign="top">This was taken on a rainy NW day. Just down for Bonnaville dam near Portland Or. Really surpised it scored as well as it did. Had a tough time processing this one. Yes heavy crop, over saturated which you see in the face. The water is running fast, we''ve had a lot of rain lately, the water is pretty brown. But, I really like the capture of the two enjoying there catch..........Thanks........ace</td>', 'This was taken on a rainy NW day. Just down for Bonnaville dam near Portland Or. Really surpised it scored as well as it did. Had a tough time processing this one. Yes heavy crop, over saturated which you see in the face. The water is running fast, we''ve had a lot of rain lately, the water is pretty brown. But, I really like the capture of the two enjoying there catch..........Thanks........ace', '2005-04-28 22:40:03.000000', NULL, 0),
