(1355251, 167810, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>Thank you for the comments everyone! I didn''t really go out with the intention of taking photos for this challenge. This just happened to be in my camera after getting back from the NYC GTG on 4/17. <br/> <br/>But I must say that to anyone who thinks the statue takes precedent and takes away from the "PEOPLE" challenge, just remember that statues were people too! <br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you for the comments everyone! I didn''t really go out with the intention of taking photos for this challenge. This just happened to be in my camera after getting back from the NYC GTG on 4/17.  But I must say that to anyone who thinks the statue takes precedent and takes away from the "PEOPLE" challenge, just remember that statues were people too!  :) ', '2005-05-03 10:39:12.000000', NULL, 0),
