(1397376, 167483, 25355, '<td valign="top">This is a great candid shot - perhaps I should have bumped it up from 9, but I didn''t get around to bumping up any of them. Would it have made any difference?<br/>  Anyway, it reminds me more of ''Life of Brian'' than ''Gladiator'' - maybe there''s a similar photo in the LoB book of a Roman soldier looking somewhat bored...</td>', 'This is a great candid shot - perhaps I should have bumped it up from 9, but I didn''t get around to bumping up any of them. Would it have made any difference?  Anyway, it reminds me more of ''Life of Brian'' than ''Gladiator'' - maybe there''s a similar photo in the LoB book of a Roman soldier looking somewhat bored...', '2005-05-19 03:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
